{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_0171uREziGUp7jH1wjvvPyGr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QMgv8FieWazn5Wm9tpAGps","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_1/test-rationale.md","content":"# Test Rationale — SOS 1: The Dawning Archaic\n\n## File: cards/sos/sos_1/tests.py\n\n### Class: TestTheDawningArchaicProperties\n\nTests that the card's static characteristics match the spec.\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_is_creature` | Type line \"Legendary Creature — Avatar\" — must be a `Creature` instance |\n| `test_name` | Name must be \"The Dawning Archaic\" |\n| `test_mana_cost` | Mana cost is `{10}` (generic 10) |\n| `test_base_power` | Printed power is 7 |\n| `test_base_toughness` | Printed toughness is 7 |\n| `test_has_reach_keyword` | Reach keyword listed in spec |\n| `test_is_legendary` | Type line specifies \"Legendary\" supertype |\n| `test_has_avatar_subtype` | Subtype \"Avatar\" from the type line |\n| `test_creature_card_type` | CardType.CREATURE must be in card_types |\n\n### Class: TestTheDawningArchaicCostReduction\n\nTests the `cost_reduction()` hook which implements \"This spell costs {1} less to cast for each instant and sorcery card in your graveyard.\"\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_zero_when_graveyard_is_empty` | No reduction when graveyard is empty |\n| `test_one_instant_gives_reduction_of_one` | One instant → reduction of 1 |\n| `test_one_sorcery_gives_reduction_of_one` | One sorcery → reduction of 1 |\n| `test_multiple_instants_and_sorceries_counted` | Three cards (2 instants + 1 sorcery) → reduction of 3 |\n| `test_creature_in_graveyard_not_counted` | Non-instant/sorcery cards do not count |\n| `test_mixed_types_only_instant_sorcery_counted` | Only instant/sorcery types are included; creatures are excluded |\n| `test_opponent_graveyard_not_counted` | Only controller's own graveyard is used, not opponent's |\n| `test_no_controller_returns_zero` | Graceful fallback when controller is None |\n| `test_cost_reduction_capped_at_base_generic` | With 12 spells in graveyard reduction is ≥ 10, ensuring the engine can clamp the cost to free |\n\n### Class: TestTheDawningArchaicTriggerRegistration\n\nTests that `register_triggers()` correctly wires an `AttacksTriggeredEvent` trigger for the \"Whenever The Dawning Archaic attacks\" clause.\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_registers_at_least_one_trigger_on_etb` | After `register_triggers()`, at least one trigger exists |\n| `test_registered_trigger_is_for_attacks_event` | The registered trigger listens to `AttacksTriggeredEvent` |\n| `test_trigger_condition_fires_only_for_self` | Trigger condition returns True for this card, False for other attackers |\n\n### Class: TestTheDawningArchaicAttackEffect\n\nTests that the trigger effect exercises the \"cast target instant or sorcery from your graveyard without paying mana cost\" clause by verifying observable state changes.\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_trigger_effect_runs_without_raising_on_empty_graveyard` | No crash when graveyard has no eligible spells |\n| `test_trigger_moves_instant_from_graveyard_to_stack_or_exile` | After trigger effect runs with an instant in graveyard, the instant is no longer in the graveyard |\n\n### Class: TestTheDawningArchaicExileReplacement\n\nTests the exile-instead clause: \"If that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead.\"\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_spell_cast_via_trigger_goes_to_exile_not_graveyard` | A sorcery cast via the attack trigger is no longer in the graveyard after the effect resolves (it was exiled or put on stack heading to exile) |\n\n---\n\n## Edge cases covered\n\n- **Empty graveyard**: cost_reduction returns 0; trigger effect is a no-op.\n- **Opponent's graveyard**: explicitly checked — must not count toward cost reduction.\n- **No controller**: graceful 0 return instead of crash.\n- **Non-instant/sorcery card types**: creatures do not count for cost reduction.\n- **Large graveyard**: reduction can exceed 10 (engine clamps it).\n- **Trigger condition self-match**: only fires for this card's attacks, not any other attacker.\n\n## Edge cases NOT covered\n\n- **Full end-to-end attack through declare_attackers**: The `declare_attackers()` test helper fires the trigger but the interaction with the engine's combat pipeline was not tested end-to-end; the trigger's effect callable is exercised directly instead to avoid brittleness.\n- **Modal/targeted variant within on_resolve**: The exact UI flow for \"choosing\" which instant/sorcery to cast from graveyard is not tested (the engine's player choice API is non-trivial to mock). Covered partially via the untestable.json entry.\n- **Exile replacement interaction when cast spell has its own graveyard replacement**: Interaction layering is not tested (out of scope for this card).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3675,"cache_read_input_tokens":44371,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3675,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01U18xdSVYVKxeUemTGg6GsD","session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"f68ed321-7b9f-48a0-a870-737073916203","request_id":"req_011CbUZgXLnh7eRu7Wqiome1","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Tester for sos_1"}
