{"type":"system","subtype":"task_progress","task_id":"aca67b4ebb65f3a8f","tool_use_id":"toolu_018QE9CGFPY6KoeuZCcstpMk","description":"Writing /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_4/test-rationale.md","subagent_type":"Tester","usage":{"total_tokens":44926,"tool_uses":31,"duration_ms":117239},"last_tool_name":"Write","uuid":"e92f04c2-009c-4d3c-b713-f7972323243f","session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01RfDME57ezRMFWuJh9jFabD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01RrCmqHoJghSbgbaD6qZoNd","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_4/test-rationale.md","content":"# Test Rationale — SOS 4: Together as One\n\n## Test file: `cards/sos/sos_4/tests.py`\n\n### Card summary\n\nTogether as One is a {6} Sorcery with Converge. On resolution, X equals the number\nof distinct colors of mana spent to cast it. The three simultaneous effects are:\n- Target player draws X cards.\n- Together as One deals X damage to any target (player or creature).\n- You (the controller) gain X life.\n\n---\n\n### Class: `TestTogetherAsOneProperties`\n\nValidates static card characteristics against the card_spec:\n\n- `test_is_sorcery` — confirms `isinstance(card, Sorcery)` via the Sorcery base class.\n- `test_card_type_includes_sorcery` — `CardType.SORCERY` is in `card.card_types`.\n- `test_name` — name is exactly `\"Together as One\"`.\n- `test_mana_cost` — mana cost parses to `{6}` (6 generic, no colored pips).\n\n---\n\n### Class: `TestTogetherAsOneConverge`\n\nValidates the converge attribute contract:\n\n- `test_colors_spent_defaults_to_zero` — fresh instance has `colors_spent == 0`.\n  This is the TDD contract that forces the impl to declare the attribute.\n- `test_colors_spent_is_settable` — attribute can be assigned by the cast pipeline\n  or test setup (same pattern used in fdn_205 WardensOfTheCycle).\n\n---\n\n### Class: `TestTogetherAsOneResolveXZero`\n\nValidates the boundary case: no colored mana → X=0, all effects are no-ops:\n\n- `test_x_zero_no_cards_drawn` — hand size of target player unchanged.\n- `test_x_zero_no_damage_to_player` — target player's life unchanged.\n- `test_x_zero_no_life_gained` — controller's life unchanged.\n\nThese verify that the impl uses `colors_spent` correctly and doesn't hard-code a\npositive X value.\n\n---\n\n### Class: `TestTogetherAsOneResolveXOne`\n\nValidates that each of the three effects fires with magnitude 1:\n\n- `test_x_one_target_player_draws_one_card` — hand increases by 1 for the target\n  player. The library is pre-populated to ensure a valid draw.\n- `test_x_one_damage_target_player_takes_one_damage` — target player's life\n  decreases by 1.\n- `test_x_one_controller_gains_one_life` — controller's life increases by 1.\n\n---\n\n### Class: `TestTogetherAsOneResolveXThree`\n\nValidates scaling for a mid-range X value (3 colors):\n\n- `test_x_three_target_player_draws_three_cards` — +3 to hand.\n- `test_x_three_damage_target_takes_three` — -3 to target player life.\n- `test_x_three_controller_gains_three_life` — +3 to controller life.\n\n---\n\n### Class: `TestTogetherAsOneResolveXFive`\n\nValidates the maximum converge value (all 5 colors):\n\n- `test_x_five_target_player_draws_five_cards` — +5 to hand.\n- `test_x_five_damage_target_takes_five` — -5 to target player life.\n- `test_x_five_controller_gains_five_life` — +5 to controller life.\n\n---\n\n### Class: `TestTogetherAsOneDamageTargetCreature`\n\nThe oracle text says \"deals X damage to **any target**\", covering creatures:\n\n- `test_damage_marks_on_creature_target` — with a creature as the damage target,\n  `creature.damage_marked` increases by X. This verifies the impl dispatches\n  damage to the correct target type (creature vs. player).\n- `test_damage_to_creature_does_not_reduce_player_life` — life of the creature's\n  controller is unaffected by creature-directed damage, confirming correct dispatch.\n\n---\n\n### Class: `TestTogetherAsOneLifeGainToController`\n\nThe \"you gain X life\" clause benefits the **controller** (not the draw target):\n\n- `test_life_gain_credits_controller_not_draw_target` — when p2 is the draw\n  target and damage target but p1 is the controller, p1 gains life and p2 loses\n  life from the damage.\n\n---\n\n### Edge cases NOT covered (and why)\n\n- **Protection / hexproof on damage target**: engine-level mechanic tested in\n  engine_tests; not specific to this card's contract.\n- **Controller draws the cards (self-targeting)**: the oracle text names \"target\n  player\" separately from \"you\", but self-targeting is legal. Covered implicitly\n  by the general X=1/3/5 tests with p2 drawing, which validates the separation.\n- **Library exhaustion mid-draw**: state-based action tested in engine_tests. The\n  card's contract only concerns \"draw X cards\" — out-of-scope here.\n- **Split damage (some to creature, some to player)**: the card applies all X\n  damage to a single target; multi-target damage allocation is not part of this\n  spell.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3741,"cache_read_input_tokens":40188,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3741,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_018QE9CGFPY6KoeuZCcstpMk","session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"43ea4da3-075a-4ce7-971f-abcc164f2efb","request_id":"req_011CbUaWB5U9AQ1b3G8kkbjb","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Tester for sos_4"}
