{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01XrUPxtQ6oUDPawaFkprzZ5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018d13GPcaS45U9vinprib4F","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_4/impl-rationale.md","content":"# impl-rationale.md — TogetherAsOne (sos_4)\n\n## Design decisions\n\n### Base class\n`TogetherAsOne` extends `Sorcery` (from `engine.card`), which automatically adds `CardType.SORCERY` to `card_types` via `__init__`. This satisfies both `test_is_sorcery` and `test_card_type_includes_sorcery`.\n\n### Converge attribute\n`colors_spent` is an integer instance attribute initialized to `0` in `__init__`. It is settable freely by test code or the casting pipeline. The Converge mechanic's rules engine plumbing (counting distinct colors at cast time) is intentionally left to the casting pipeline — the card only needs to consume the value at resolution.\n\n### on_resolve structure\nThe method uses `self.colors_spent` as X and `self.chosen_targets` as a two-element list:\n- `chosen_targets[0]`: the player who draws X cards (calls `draw_card` X times via `engine.game.draw_card`)\n- `chosen_targets[1]`: the damage target (player or creature), passed to `engine.game.deal_damage`\n- `self.controller`: the life-gain recipient, via direct `controller.life += x`\n\nUsing `engine.game.deal_damage` for damage correctly handles the player vs. creature distinction (reduces `life` for players, increments `damage_marked` for creatures) and fires the appropriate triggered events.\n\nUsing `engine.game.draw_card` for drawing correctly fires `DrawsCardTriggeredEvent` and handles the empty-library edge case.\n\nLife gain uses a direct `controller.life += x` which is consistent with other engine functions that grant life (e.g., `engine/game.py` lifelink handling, `engine/combat.py`).\n\n### Early return for X=0\nWhen `x <= 0`, the method returns immediately without doing anything, so all three \"X=0\" test cases pass without side effects.\n\n## Conventions established\n- Converge spells store `colors_spent` on the card object (set before resolution).\n- `chosen_targets` for this card is a 2-element list: `[draw_target, damage_target]`.\n- No engine modifications were needed; all behavior is implemented entirely within the card's `on_resolve` method.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":986,"cache_read_input_tokens":43671,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":986,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":45,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01MNDSb3ogRfWtcyJ38po5Aj","session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"8534a09b-c0ed-41b7-9ce0-bc1c7f156caf","request_id":"req_011CbUahXtvJz41qBfPpwWsv","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implementer for sos_4"}
