{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MZfckBZ8RSDKwCthscHWXf","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Test Utilities API Reference\n2\t\n3\tHelper functions for writing card tests. Import from `test_utils`.\n4\t\n5\t## Functions\n6\t\n7\t### `create_game`\n8\t\n9\t`create_game(deck1=None, deck2=None, *, player1_life=20, player2_life=20, scripts=None) -> GameState`\n10\t\n11\tCreate a two-player game with `DeterministicPlayer` instances. Decks default to empty lists.\n12\t\n13\t```python\n14\tfrom test_utils import create_game\n15\tgame = create_game(player1_life=25)\n16\t```\n17\t\n18\t### `set_board_state`\n19\t\n20\t`set_board_state(game, player_index, *, battlefield=None, hand=None, graveyard=None, life=None, mana=None) -> None`\n21\t\n22\tSet zone contents and player state. Only zones explicitly provided are modified.\n23\t\n24\t- **hand / battlefield / graveyard** — `list` of card objects.\n25\t- **mana** — `dict[ManaType, int]`.\n26\t\n27\t```python\n28\tfrom test_utils import create_game, set_board_state\n29\tfrom engine.types import ManaType\n30\tfrom cards.fdn.fdn_13.card_impl import FleetingFlight\n31\tfrom engine.card import Creature\n32\t\n33\tgame = create_game()\n34\tset_board_state(game, 0, hand=[FleetingFlight(owner=None)], mana={ManaType.WHITE: 2})\n35\tbear = Creature(name=\"Grizzly Bears\", base_power=2, base_toughness=2)\n36\tset_board_state(game, 1, battlefield=[bear], life=15)\n37\t```\n38\t\n39\t### `cast_spell`\n40\t\n41\t`cast_spell(game, player_index, card_name, targets=None) -> None`\n42\t\n43\tFind a card in hand by name, cast it, and resolve. Sets sorcery-speed timing automatically.\n44\t\n45\t```python\n46\tfrom test_utils import create_game, set_board_state, cast_spell\n47\tfrom engine.types import ManaType\n48\tfrom cards.fdn.fdn_13.card_impl import FleetingFlight\n49\t\n50\tgame = create_game()\n51\tset_board_state(game, 0, hand=[FleetingFlight(owner=None)], mana={ManaType.WHITE: 2})\n52\tcast_spell(game, 0, \"Fleeting Flight\")\n53\t```\n54\t\n55\t### `advance_to_phase`\n56\t\n57\t`advance_to_phase(game, phase, step=None) -> None`\n58\t\n59\tFast-forward to the specified phase/step without granting priority.\n60\t\n61\t```python\n62\tfrom test_utils import create_game, advance_to_phase\n63\tfrom engine.types import Phase, Step\n64\t\n65\tgame = create_game()\n66\tadvance_to_phase(game, Phase.COMBAT, Step.DECLARE_ATTACKERS)\n67\t```\n68\t\n69\t### `declare_attackers`\n70\t\n71\t`declare_attackers(game, attacker_names) -> None`\n72\t\n73\tAdvance to combat and declare creatures as attackers by name from the active player's battlefield.\n74\t\n75\t```python\n76\tfrom test_utils import create_game, set_board_state, declare_attackers\n77\tfrom engine.card import Creature\n78\t\n79\tgame = create_game()\n80\tbear = Creature(name=\"Grizzly Bears\", base_power=2, base_toughness=2)\n81\tset_board_state(game, 0, battlefield=[bear])\n82\tdeclare_attackers(game, [\"Grizzly Bears\"])\n83\t```\n84\t\n85\t### `declare_blockers`\n86\t\n87\t`declare_blockers(game, assignments) -> None`\n88\t\n89\tAssign blockers by name mapping: `{\"attacker_name\": [\"blocker_name\", ...]}`.\n90\t\n91\t```python\n92\tfrom test_utils import create_game, set_board_state, declare_attackers, declare_blockers\n93\tfrom engine.card import Creature\n94\t\n95\tgame = create_game()\n96\tbear = Creature(name=\"Grizzly Bears\", base_power=2, base_toughness=2)\n97\twall = Creature(name=\"Wall of Wood\", base_power=0, base_toughness=3)\n98\tset_board_state(game, 0, battlefield=[bear])\n99\tset_board_state(game, 1, battlefield=[wall])\n100\tdeclare_attackers(game, [\"Grizzly Bears\"])\n101\tdeclare_blockers(game, {\"Grizzly Bears\": [\"Wall of Wood\"]})\n102\t```\n103\t\n104\t## Test Structure\n105\t\n106\t```python\n107\timport pytest\n108\tfrom test_utils import create_game, set_board_state, cast_spell\n109\tfrom cards.sos.sos_1.card_impl import TheDawningArchaic\n110\tfrom engine.types import ManaType\n111\t\n112\tclass TestTheDawningArchaic:\n113\t    def test_basic_cast(self):\n114\t        game = create_game()\n115\t        set_board_state(game, 0, hand=[TheDawningArchaic(owner=None)],\n116\t                        mana={ManaType.COLORLESS: 10})\n117\t        cast_spell(game, 0, \"The Dawning Archaic\")\n118\t        assert game.players[0].life == 20\n119\t```\n120\t\n121\t## Constraints\n122\t\n123\t- **Max 30 tests per card.**\n124\t- Import helpers from `test_utils`.\n125\t- Import card implementations from `cards.sos.sos_<N>.card_impl` (SOS cards you\n126\t  are building) or `cards.fdn.fdn_<N>.card_impl` (FDN reference cards).\n127\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01888PDpT65h8bYdpL8FstJV","session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"2464363f-fadb-458c-b922-4e948044b80e","timestamp":"2026-05-28T07:39:12.477Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Tester for sos_13"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MR8zWuehvzB6fjPGmNTcSh","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t\"\"\"Reference test for FDN 13 — Fleeting Flight.\n2\t\n3\tIllustrative test covering **target selection / validation**. Fleeting\n4\tFlight is a targeted instant: ``get_targets()`` returns a\n5\t``TargetRequirement`` describing what is legal, and the cast pipeline\n6\tpopulates ``chosen_targets`` with the player's selection. ``on_resolve``\n7\treads ``chosen_targets`` and applies the effect to the chosen target.\n8\t\"\"\"\n9\t\n10\tfrom __future__ import annotations\n11\t\n12\tfrom cards.fdn.fdn_13.card_impl import FleetingFlight\n13\tfrom engine.card import Creature, Instant\n14\tfrom engine.types import (\n15\t    CardType,\n16\t    Keyword,\n17\t    ManaCost,\n18\t    TargetRequirement,\n19\t    Zone,\n20\t)\n21\tfrom test_utils import create_game\n22\t\n23\t\n24\tclass TestFleetingFlightProperties:\n25\t    \"\"\"Static card data should match the FDN 13 spec.\"\"\"\n26\t\n27\t    def test_is_instant(self) -> None:\n28\t        assert isinstance(FleetingFlight(owner=None), Instant)\n29\t\n30\t    def test_name(self) -> None:\n31\t        assert FleetingFlight(owner=None).name == \"Fleeting Flight\"\n32\t\n33\t    def test_mana_cost(self) -> None:\n34\t        assert FleetingFlight(owner=None).mana_cost == ManaCost.parse(\"{W}\")\n35\t\n36\t\n37\tclass TestFleetingFlightTargeting:\n38\t    \"\"\"get_targets() advertises a single creature target on the battlefield.\"\"\"\n39\t\n40\t    def test_returns_single_target_requirement(self) -> None:\n41\t        game = create_game()\n42\t        reqs = FleetingFlight(owner=None).get_targets(game)\n43\t        assert isinstance(reqs, list)\n44\t        assert len(reqs) == 1\n45\t        assert isinstance(reqs[0], TargetRequirement)\n46\t\n47\t    def test_target_zone_is_battlefield(self) -> None:\n48\t        game = create_game()\n49\t        req = FleetingFlight(owner=None).get_targets(game)[0]\n50\t        assert req.zone == Zone.BATTLEFIELD\n51\t\n52\t    def test_target_filter_accepts_creature(self) -> None:\n53\t        \"\"\"The filter must accept creatures and reject non-creatures.\"\"\"\n54\t        game = create_game()\n55\t        req = FleetingFlight(owner=None).get_targets(game)[0]\n56\t\n57\t        creature = Creature(name=\"Test Bear\", base_power=2, base_toughness=2)\n58\t        creature.card_types = {CardType.CREATURE}\n59\t        non_creature = Creature(name=\"Not a creature\")  # no card_types\n60\t        non_creature.card_types = set()\n61\t\n62\t        assert req.filter_fn(creature) is True\n63\t        assert req.filter_fn(non_creature) is False\n64\t\n65\t\n66\tclass TestFleetingFlightResolution:\n67\t    \"\"\"on_resolve reads chosen_targets and applies the effect.\"\"\"\n68\t\n69\t    def test_no_target_is_a_noop(self) -> None:\n70\t        game = create_game()\n71\t        p1 = game.players[0]\n72\t        spell = FleetingFlight(owner=p1, controller=p1)\n73\t        # chosen_targets is unset — resolution must not raise.\n74\t        spell.on_resolve(game)\n75\t\n76\t    def test_chosen_target_receives_counter_and_flying(self) -> None:\n77\t        game = create_game()\n78\t        p1 = game.players[0]\n79\t\n80\t        # Put a vanilla bear on the battlefield as the target.\n81\t        bear = Creature(\n82\t            name=\"Grizzly Bears\",\n83\t            owner=p1,\n84\t            controller=p1,\n85\t            base_power=2,\n86\t            base_toughness=2,\n87\t        )\n88\t        bear.card_types = {CardType.CREATURE}\n89\t        game.get_battlefield(p1).add(bear)\n90\t\n91\t        spell = FleetingFlight(owner=p1, controller=p1)\n92\t        # The cast pipeline would set chosen_targets; we set it directly\n93\t        # to validate that on_resolve reads it correctly.\n94\t        spell.chosen_targets = [bear]\n95\t        before = bear.plus_one_counters\n96\t        spell.on_resolve(game)\n97\t        # +1/+1 counter applied to the chosen target.\n98\t        assert bear.plus_one_counters == before + 1\n99\t        # Damage-prevention flag set per the card's \"prevent all combat\n100\t        # damage\" clause.\n101\t        assert bear.combat_damage_prevented is True\n102\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01888PDpT65h8bYdpL8FstJV","session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"9b6d2ae4-f80a-4788-b29b-4ff297174003","timestamp":"2026-05-28T07:39:12.478Z","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Tester for sos_13"}
