{"type":"system","subtype":"task_progress","task_id":"a569c1c64d5060157","tool_use_id":"toolu_01888PDpT65h8bYdpL8FstJV","description":"Writing /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/test-rationale.md","subagent_type":"Tester","usage":{"total_tokens":59948,"tool_uses":44,"duration_ms":185508},"last_tool_name":"Write","uuid":"535f4596-fd9b-4fc0-b0bd-0f55188fe5f4","session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01Q8oW33rwB6BwWerMGhNvwd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Exs6iywd4A8toZnQF2eo7E","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/test-rationale.md","content":"# Test Rationale — sos_13: Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares\n\n## File: cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py\n\n### TestEmeritusProperties — Static card properties\n\nEach test verifies one printed characteristic:\n- `test_is_creature` — class is a `Creature` subclass (not plain `CardImpl`).\n- `test_name` — front-face name contains \"Emeritus of Truce\".\n- `test_mana_cost` — parses to `{1}{W}{W}`.\n- `test_base_power` / `test_base_toughness` — both 3.\n- `test_is_legendary` — `Supertype.LEGENDARY` present.\n- `test_has_cat_subtype` / `test_has_cleric_subtype` — type line \"Cat Cleric\".\n- `test_creature_card_type` — `CardType.CREATURE` in `card_types`.\n- `test_color_is_white` — at least 2 white pips in mana cost.\n\n### TestEmeritusInitialState — Prepared mechanic defaults\n\n- `test_is_prepared_defaults_to_false` — fresh instance has `is_prepared = False`.\n- `test_is_prepared_is_accessible` — attribute exists even before any game action.\n\nEdge case not covered: checking that `is_prepared` is a plain boolean vs. a property — testing presence and falsy value is sufficient per project conventions.\n\n### TestEmeritusETBTriggerRegistration — Trigger wiring\n\n- `test_registers_at_least_one_trigger` — `register_triggers()` adds to the manager.\n- `test_registered_trigger_watches_etb_event` — trigger type is `EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent`.\n- `test_trigger_condition_fires_for_self` — condition returns True when `permanent` is the card.\n- `test_trigger_condition_does_not_fire_for_other_permanent` — condition returns False for a different permanent.\n\nCondition tests are guarded by `if trigger.condition is not None` (same pattern as sos_1 tests) since an unconditional trigger also satisfies the requirement.\n\n### TestEmeritusInklingTokenCreation — ETB token effect\n\nThe ETB effect is invoked directly via `triggers[0].effect(game)` (same pattern as sos_1 tests).\n\n- `test_etb_effect_creates_token_for_controller` — at least one creature appears on some battlefield.\n- `test_etb_creates_exactly_one_token` — exactly one permanent is added across all battlefields.\n- `test_inkling_token_is_one_one` — first token found has `base_power == 1`, `base_toughness == 1`.\n- `test_inkling_token_has_inkling_subtype` — token has `\"Inkling\"` in `subtypes`.\n- `test_inkling_token_has_flying` — token has `Keyword.FLYING`.\n\nEdge cases not covered: \"white and black\" color identity of the token — the engine does not expose a `colors` attribute on tokens as a public contract, and checking `mana_cost` is not meaningful for tokens. Recorded in `untestable.json`.\n\n### TestEmeritusBecomesPreared — Prepared condition check\n\n- `test_becomes_prepared_when_opponent_has_more_creatures` — p2 has 3 creatures, p1 has Emeritus; after token p1=2, p2=3 → prepared.\n- `test_not_prepared_when_opponent_does_not_have_more_creatures` — p1 has many creatures → not prepared.\n- `test_not_prepared_when_opponent_has_equal_creatures` — exact tie → not prepared (\"more\" is strict).\n- `test_starts_not_prepared_before_etb_fires` — register_triggers alone does not set prepared.\n\n### TestEmeritusSpellCopyEffect — Swords to Plowshares copy\n\nTests call `card.cast_prepared_spell(game, target)` directly, which is the expected public method the implementation must expose for the spell-copy effect.\n\n- `test_cast_spell_copy_exiles_target_creature` — target leaves battlefield and is found in exile.\n- `test_cast_spell_copy_grants_life_equal_to_power` — power=5 creature → controller gains 5 life.\n- `test_cast_prepared_spell_unprepares_card` — `is_prepared` becomes False after casting.\n- `test_cast_prepared_spell_zero_power_gains_no_life` — edge case: 0-power → 0 life gained.\n- `test_cannot_cast_prepared_spell_when_not_prepared` — not prepared → no effect and no crash.\n- `test_life_gained_matches_power_at_exile_time` — power=4 → gains 4.\n\nEdge cases not covered:\n- Target with +1/+1 counters affecting power at exile time (no simple way to set up via public API in isolation).\n- \"Copy\" semantics vs. actual casting (copy does not go on stack — this depends on implementation).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6188,"cache_read_input_tokens":52038,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6188,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01888PDpT65h8bYdpL8FstJV","session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"d301cc8b-917c-46d7-b034-f1bc0e55da42","request_id":"req_011CbUbAjxhqSSVUEGsVLUs1","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Tester for sos_13"}
