{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01888PDpT65h8bYdpL8FstJV","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"30 of 31 tests fail against the stub (correct TDD red phase). The 1 passing test is `test_cannot_cast_prepared_spell_when_not_prepared` — it passes because the unimplemented stub raises an `AttributeError` on `cast_prepared_spell`, which the test's `try/except` catches, and then it asserts the target was not exiled and life was not changed (both trivially true since no effect ran). This is acceptable — the test still verifies meaningful behavior (the not-prepared guard must prevent the exile/life-gain effects), and it will continue to pass correctly once implemented if the implementation properly no-ops when not prepared.\n\n```\nTESTS_WRITTEN\ntest_files: 1\ntest_cases: 31\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/test-rationale.md\nfiles_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/test-files.txt\nuntestable_count: 2\nuntestable_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/untestable.json\nnotes: wrote 31 test cases for sos_13 Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares; covers static properties, is_prepared initial state, ETB trigger registration/condition, Inkling token creation (1/1, flying, subtype), prepared condition (opponent-more/equal/fewer), STP copy effect (exile, life gain, unpreparation, zero-power edge case, not-prepared guard)\n```"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a569c1c64d5060157 (use SendMessage with to: 'a569c1c64d5060157' to continue this agent)\n<usage>total_tokens: 62942\ntool_uses: 50\nduration_ms: 224297</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"425dd7ce-30ad-464d-b3cb-a94c9ee44dd5","timestamp":"2026-05-28T07:42:46.287Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Write pytest tests for the SOS card sos_13 (Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares).\n\nCard spec path: /workspace/cards/sos/sos_13/card_spec.json\nCard impl stub: /workspace/cards/sos/sos_13/card_impl.py\nOutput directory: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/\n\nKey files for context:\n- AGENTS.md: /workspace/AGENTS.md\n- PROJECT_MAP.md: /workspace/PROJECT_MAP.md\n- KEY_DECISIONS.md: /workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md\n- FILES_MODIFIED.json: /workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json\n- test_utils reference: /workspace/test_utils.md\n- Example test files: /workspace/cards/fdn/fdn_13/tests.py, /workspace/cards/fdn/fdn_142/tests.py, /workspace/cards/fdn/fdn_205/tests.py\n- Engine source: /workspace/engine/card.py, /workspace/engine/events.py, /workspace/engine/triggers.py, /workspace/engine/replacement_effects.py, /workspace/engine/zones.py\n\nCARD DESCRIPTION:\nEmeritus of Truce is a 3/3 Legendary Creature — Cat Cleric with mana cost {1}{W}{W}.\nWhen this creature enters, target player creates a 1/1 white and black Inkling creature token with flying. Then if an opponent controls more creatures than you, this creature becomes prepared.\n\n\"Prepared\" mechanic: While it's prepared, you may cast a copy of its spell (Swords to Plowshares - {W} instant that exiles target creature and its controller gains life equal to its power). Doing so unprepares it.\n\nThe card is a double-faced card (DFC):\n- Front face: Emeritus of Truce (Creature 3/3)\n- Back face/spell: Swords to Plowshares (Instant {W}: Exile target creature, its controller gains life equal to its power)\n\nFocus your tests on:\n1. Card static properties (name, power/toughness, type, colors)\n2. ETB trigger creates an Inkling token for target player\n3. ETB trigger checks if opponent controls more creatures than you - becomes prepared if so\n4. The \"prepared\" state: is_prepared attribute\n5. When prepared, can cast a copy of the spell (Swords to Plowshares effect)\n6. After casting the copy while prepared, the card becomes unprepared\n\nWrite tests to `cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py` (path relative to workspace root /workspace/).\nOutput test-rationale.md and test-files.txt to /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/.\n\ntest-files.txt should contain the path: cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py\n\nReturn a short status summary with untestable_count.","agentId":"a569c1c64d5060157","agentType":"Tester","content":[{"type":"text","text":"30 of 31 tests fail against the stub (correct TDD red phase). The 1 passing test is `test_cannot_cast_prepared_spell_when_not_prepared` — it passes because the unimplemented stub raises an `AttributeError` on `cast_prepared_spell`, which the test's `try/except` catches, and then it asserts the target was not exiled and life was not changed (both trivially true since no effect ran). This is acceptable — the test still verifies meaningful behavior (the not-prepared guard must prevent the exile/life-gain effects), and it will continue to pass correctly once implemented if the implementation properly no-ops when not prepared.\n\n```\nTESTS_WRITTEN\ntest_files: 1\ntest_cases: 31\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/test-rationale.md\nfiles_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/test-files.txt\nuntestable_count: 2\nuntestable_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/untestable.json\nnotes: wrote 31 test cases for sos_13 Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares; covers static properties, is_prepared initial state, ETB trigger registration/condition, Inkling token creation (1/1, flying, subtype), prepared condition (opponent-more/equal/fewer), STP copy effect (exile, life gain, unpreparation, zero-power edge case, not-prepared guard)\n```"}],"totalDurationMs":224297,"totalTokens":62942,"totalToolUseCount":50,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":563,"cache_read_input_tokens":62019,"output_tokens":359,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":563},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":359,"cache_read_input_tokens":62019,"cache_creation_input_tokens":563,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":