{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01VWpDAYq92s6rtM94FRgXAA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Em6NA6YTV7UHu7EhoLyLkE","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Implementer for sos_13","subagent_type":"Implementer","prompt":"Implement the SOS card sos_13 (Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares) to make all tests pass.\n\nCard spec: /workspace/cards/sos/sos_13/card_spec.json\nTests file: /workspace/cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py\nImplementation file: /workspace/cards/sos/sos_13/card_impl.py\n\nKey context files:\n- AGENTS.md: /workspace/AGENTS.md\n- PROJECT_MAP.md: /workspace/PROJECT_MAP.md\n- KEY_DECISIONS.md: /workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md\n- FILES_MODIFIED.json: /workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json\n- test_utils reference: /workspace/test_utils.md\n- Engine source: /workspace/engine/card.py, /workspace/engine/events.py, /workspace/engine/triggers.py, /workspace/engine/replacement_effects.py, /workspace/engine/zones.py\n- FDN reference implementations: /workspace/cards/fdn/\n\nCARD DESCRIPTION:\nEmeritus of Truce is a 3/3 Legendary Creature — Cat Cleric (white) with mana cost {1}{W}{W}.\n\nThe \"Prepared\" mechanic:\n- When this creature enters the battlefield, target player creates a 1/1 white and black Inkling creature token with flying.\n- THEN: if an opponent controls more creatures than you, this creature becomes \"prepared\" (set is_prepared = True).\n- While prepared, you may cast a copy of its spell (Swords to Plowshares: exile target creature, its controller gains life equal to that creature's power).\n- Casting the copy unprepares it (is_prepared = False).\n\nImplementation requirements:\n1. The class must be a Creature subclass with:\n   - name = \"Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares\"\n   - base_power = 3, base_toughness = 3\n   - is_prepared = False (starts unprepared)\n   - is_legendary = True (LEGENDARY supertype)\n   - card_types includes CardType.CREATURE\n\n2. ETB trigger (EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent):\n   - Effect: chosen target player gets a 1/1 flying Inkling token (subtype = {\"Inkling\"}, is_creature=True, base_power=1, base_toughness=1, keywords=[Keyword.FLYING])\n   - Then check: if any opponent controls strictly more creatures than this card's controller → set self.is_prepared = True\n\n3. Method cast_prepared_spell(game, target_creature):\n   - If not is_prepared: no-op\n   - If is_prepared: exile target_creature (move to exile zone), its controller gains life equal to the creature's base_power (fire GainsLifeTriggeredEvent), then set is_prepared = False\n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n- Make ALL tests in cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py pass.\n- Do NOT modify the test file.\n- Write output to /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/impl.diff, impl-rationale.md, impl-files.txt\n- Upsert this card's entry into /workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json\n\nReturn either:\nIMPL_DONE\nfiles_changed: N\ntests_passing: all\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/impl.diff\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/impl-rationale.md\nnotes: one-line summary\n\nOR:\nDISPUTE\ntests_failing: N\ndisputed_tests: list\ndispute_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/test-dispute.md\nnotes: one-line summary"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":349,"cache_read_input_tokens":35747,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":349},"output_tokens":51,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"63cac58b-e3f5-4a1a-aa28-b76aaa6c4932","request_id":"req_011CbUbG32WVCDoXgEPxA7w1"}
