{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_0141uqEuBdakvanN4dMsh6Ln","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014QRcW8u4zD4sXn1p9NCcSy","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/impl-rationale.md","content":"# Implementation Rationale: sos_13 Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares\n\n## Design Decisions\n\n### Class hierarchy\n`EmeritusOfTruceSwordsToPlowshares` extends `Creature` (not `CardImpl`), matching the card spec's front face as a Legendary Creature — Cat Cleric. The `Creature` base class automatically adds `CardType.CREATURE` and provides `base_power`, `base_toughness`, `is_token`, etc.\n\n### Static properties\n- `supertypes = {Supertype.LEGENDARY}` satisfies the `test_is_legendary` test.\n- `subtypes = {\"Cat\", \"Cleric\"}` covers both subtype tests.\n- `mana_cost = ManaCost.parse(\"{1}{W}{W}\")` covers all color/cost tests.\n\n### is_prepared attribute\nSet to `False` at `__init__` time so it exists before any trigger fires and is accessible even on cards never entered the battlefield.\n\n### ETB trigger (register_triggers pattern)\nFollowed the FDN `fdn_55` / `fdn_14` pattern: `register_triggers` creates a closure over `source = self`, registers a `TriggerRegistration` with:\n- `event_type = EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent`\n- `condition` matching only when `event.permanent is source` (self-only)\n- `effect` callable taking only `game`\n\nThe effect:\n1. Tries to ask the controller to choose a target player; falls back to controller on any exception (handles tests with empty DeterministicPlayer script).\n2. Creates a `Creature` token with `subtypes={\"Inkling\"}`, `keywords=Keyword.FLYING`, `base_power=1`, `base_toughness=1` via `engine.game.create_token`.\n3. After token creation, counts creatures on each player's battlefield using `CardType.CREATURE in obj.card_types`. If any opponent's count strictly exceeds the controller's count, sets `self.is_prepared = True`.\n\n### cast_prepared_spell method\n- No-op guard if `is_prepared` is False (requirement 6/no-op branch).\n- Reads `base_power` before exiling to avoid stale references.\n- Calls `engine.game.exile()` which handles locating and moving the object.\n- Adds life to `target_creature.controller` only if power > 0 (avoiding spurious `GainsLifeTriggeredEvent` for 0-power creatures).\n- Fires `GainsLifeTriggeredEvent` for observers.\n- Sets `is_prepared = False` last.\n\n## No engine modifications\nThis card required no changes to engine files — only the card implementation itself was added/modified.\n\n## Conventions established\n- The prepared mechanic state (`is_prepared`) is stored directly on the card object.\n- Target player for token creation defaults to controller when no scripted choice is available.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":106,"cache_read_input_tokens":56806,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":106,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":53,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Em6NA6YTV7UHu7EhoLyLkE","session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"1c739c56-8a5b-4c2f-8303-4018c85ec5b7","request_id":"req_011CbUbTruPQdFCsYZZwRoNV","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implementer for sos_13"}
