rget player creates a 1/1 white and black Inkling creature token with flying.\n- THEN: if an opponent controls more creatures than you, this creature becomes \"prepared\" (set is_prepared = True).\n- While prepared, you may cast a copy of its spell (Swords to Plowshares: exile target creature, its controller gains life equal to that creature's power).\n- Casting the copy unprepares it (is_prepared = False).\n\nImplementation requirements:\n1. The class must be a Creature subclass with:\n   - name = \"Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares\"\n   - base_power = 3, base_toughness = 3\n   - is_prepared = False (starts unprepared)\n   - is_legendary = True (LEGENDARY supertype)\n   - card_types includes CardType.CREATURE\n\n2. ETB trigger (EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent):\n   - Effect: chosen target player gets a 1/1 flying Inkling token (subtype = {\"Inkling\"}, is_creature=True, base_power=1, base_toughness=1, keywords=[Keyword.FLYING])\n   - Then check: if any opponent controls strictly more creatures than this card's controller → set self.is_prepared = True\n\n3. Method cast_prepared_spell(game, target_creature):\n   - If not is_prepared: no-op\n   - If is_prepared: exile target_creature (move to exile zone), its controller gains life equal to the creature's base_power (fire GainsLifeTriggeredEvent), then set is_prepared = False\n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n- Make ALL tests in cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py pass.\n- Do NOT modify the test file.\n- Write output to /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/impl.diff, impl-rationale.md, impl-files.txt\n- Upsert this card's entry into /workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json\n\nReturn either:\nIMPL_DONE\nfiles_changed: N\ntests_passing: all\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/impl.diff\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/impl-rationale.md\nnotes: one-line summary\n\nOR:\nDISPUTE\ntests_failing: N\ndisputed_tests: list\ndispute_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/test-dispute.md\nnotes: one-line summary","agentId":"a427640e30eacb384","agentType":