{"type":"system","subtype":"task_progress","task_id":"a4cd1d8a236eede65","tool_use_id":"toolu_01HgzLdpMVtRV8CxJEvbBeFj","description":"Writing /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/impl-revised-rationale.md","subagent_type":"Implementer","usage":{"total_tokens":16706,"tool_uses":8,"duration_ms":32875},"last_tool_name":"Write","uuid":"f62469e5-656c-44c4-a63b-dc3c80ee4df8","session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_011q3kB88B3G5zwYmEoS6rz4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014RiaERBKbFit1gjAMSPEBu","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_13/impl-revised-rationale.md","content":"# Revision Rationale — sos_13 Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares\n\n## Strict issue addressed\n\n**Line 131 — use current power, not base_power**\n\nSwords to Plowshares (rule 701.13a) grants life equal to the creature's *current* power at the time it is exiled, not its base power. A creature with +1/+1 counters, -1/-1 counters, or other continuous effects modifying its power would have given the wrong amount of life with the old `base_power` read.\n\nChanged:\n```python\npower = getattr(target_creature, \"base_power\", 0)\n```\nto:\n```python\npower = getattr(target_creature, \"power\", getattr(target_creature, \"base_power\", 0))\n```\n\nThe outer `getattr` first tries the `power` property (which the `Creature` class exposes as the fully-modified in-game value), then falls back to `base_power` if the attribute is absent on a mock or minimal object. This preserves test compatibility while correcting the rules behaviour.\n\n## Advisory comments (no change made)\n\n- **Token color**: acknowledged. The Inkling token lacks explicit color information because the engine derives color from `mana_cost`, which tokens don't have. Fixing this properly would require an engine-level `colors` attribute — deferred, as it is advisory and all current tests pass.\n- **Zero-power life-gain event**: acknowledged. The guard `power > 0` skips the `GainsLifeTriggeredEvent` at zero power. Technically the rules say the player \"gains 0 life\" but in practice this fires no triggered abilities and all tests pass. Deferred as advisory.\n\n## Tests\nAll 31 tests pass with no modifications to the test file.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":408,"cache_read_input_tokens":16126,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":408,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":55,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01HgzLdpMVtRV8CxJEvbBeFj","session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"1b3ff5da-616b-429d-b542-bb6b07ac9d4b","request_id":"req_011CbUbexCSYvZDmdWo4mpch","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implementer revision for sos_13"}
