D)\nengine/casting.py-408-    else:\nengine/casting.py-409-        # Instant/sorcery: check for \"exile instead of graveyard\" replacement\n--\n/workspace/engine/casting.py-423-        destination_str = getattr(replacement_event, \"destination\", \"graveyard\")\n/workspace/engine/casting.py-424-        destination_zone = Zone.GRAVEYARD if destination_str == \"graveyard\" else Zone.EXILE\nengine/casting.py:425:        move_to_zone(game, card, Zone.STACK, destination_zone)\n/workspace/engine/casting.py-426-\n/workspace/engine/casting.py-427-\n--\n/workspace/engine/game_state.py-21-    (Phase.BEGINNING, Step.DRAW),\n/workspace/engine/game_state.py-22-    # Precombat main phase\nengine/game_state.py:23:    (Phase.PRECOMBAT_MAIN, None),\n/workspace/engine/game_state.py-24-    # Combat phase\n/workspace/engine/game_state.py-25-    (Phase.COMBAT, Step.BEGIN_COMBAT),\n--\n/workspace/engine/game_state.py-29-    (Phase.COMBAT, Step.END_COMBAT),\n/workspace/engine/game_state.py-30-    # Postcombat main phase\nengine/game_state.py:31:    (Phase.POSTCOMBAT_MAIN, None),\n/workspace/engine/game_state.py-32-    # Ending phase\n/workspace/engine/game_state.py-33-    (Phase.ENDING, Step.END),\n--\nengine/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md-16-| `game_state.py` | 180+ | `GameState` — central state container holding players, stack, trigger/effect/replacement managers, combat state, phase/step tracking, turn number, priority index. `extra_turns: list[int]` FIFO queue for extra turn management. `_normal_next_index` for tracking normal rotation independently. `_TURN_SEQUENCE` constant. `advance_phase()` for turn progression (pops extra turns without advancing normal rotation). |\n/workspace/engine/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md-17-| `stack.py` | 174 | `StackObject` dataclass, `Stack` (LIFO container), `priority_loop()` with auto-pass and stack resolution, `check_state_based_actions()` wrapper. |\nengine/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md:18:[Omitted long matching line]\n/workspace/engine/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md-19-| `combat.py` |