{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01RMs8SVy8hHLjNhDrxCGDXp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01B12V1T6aFHpjnG84D8LMpj","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_57/test-rationale.md","content":"# Test Rationale — sos_57 Mana Sculpt\n\n## File: `cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py`\n\n### TestManaSculptProperties (5 tests)\n\nVerifies static card metadata against the spec:\n\n- `test_name` — card name is \"Mana Sculpt\".\n- `test_is_instant` — class inherits from `engine.card.Instant`.\n- `test_has_instant_card_type` — `CardType.INSTANT` is in `card_types`.\n- `test_mana_cost` — mana cost parses to `{1}{U}{U}`.\n- `test_mana_cost_cmc` — CMC is 3.\n\n### TestManaSculptTargeting (4 tests)\n\nVerifies the card's `get_targets()` contract for targeting spells on the stack:\n\n- `test_returns_one_target_requirement` — exactly one `TargetRequirement` returned.\n- `test_target_requirement_is_correct_type` — the requirement is a `TargetRequirement` instance.\n- `test_target_zone_is_stack` — the requirement points at `Zone.STACK`.\n- `test_target_filter_accepts_stack_spell` — the filter accepts a `StackObject`.\n\n### TestManaSculptCounterspell (4 tests)\n\nVerifies the counterspell mechanic (removes the chosen `StackObject` from the stack):\n\n- `test_counters_target_spell_removes_from_stack` — stack goes from 1 to 0 after resolution.\n- `test_countered_spell_no_longer_in_stack_items` — the specific target object is absent from `game.stack.objects()`.\n- `test_counters_only_target_spell_leaves_other_spells` — only the chosen target is removed; other stack objects remain.\n- `test_no_target_is_a_noop` — when `chosen_targets` is empty, `on_resolve` returns without raising.\n\n### TestManaSculptNoWizard (2 tests)\n\nVerifies the conditional \"If you control a Wizard\" branch when no Wizard is present:\n\n- `test_no_trigger_registered_without_wizard` — no new triggers are added to `trigger_manager` after resolution without a Wizard.\n- `test_no_mana_added_without_wizard` — colorless mana pool stays at 0 immediately after resolution.\n\n### TestManaSculptWithWizard (4 tests)\n\nVerifies the Wizard-conditional branch registers the delayed mana trigger:\n\n- `test_trigger_registered_when_wizard_present` — at least one new trigger is registered when a Wizard is on the caster's battlefield.\n- `test_trigger_registered_exactly_one_when_wizard_present` — exactly one new trigger is added.\n- `test_trigger_is_controlled_by_caster` — the new trigger's controller is the spell's controller (p1).\n- `test_no_trigger_when_opponent_has_wizard_not_controller` — a Wizard on the opponent's battlefield does not satisfy the condition.\n\n### TestManaSculptManaAmount (5 tests)\n\nVerifies the mana quantity and type produced when the delayed trigger fires. These tests directly invoke the registered trigger's effect callable (bypassing the event firing pipeline, since no `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` yet exists in the engine):\n\n- `test_mana_added_equals_cmc_of_countered_spell_cmc3` — countering a 3-CMC spell adds 3 {C}.\n- `test_mana_added_equals_cmc_of_countered_spell_cmc5` — countering a 5-CMC spell adds 5 {C}.\n- `test_mana_added_equals_cmc_of_countered_spell_cmc1` — countering a 1-CMC spell adds 1 {C}.\n- `test_mana_added_is_colorless_not_colored` — only `ManaType.COLORLESS` is added; all colored types are 0.\n- `test_mana_amount_zero_cmc_spell` — countering a 0-CMC spell adds 0 mana.\n\n---\n\n## Edge cases covered\n- Empty `chosen_targets` (no-op safety).\n- Multiple spells on the stack (only the target is removed).\n- Opponent has a Wizard (does not satisfy the condition — only the controller's battlefield counts).\n- Zero-CMC countered spell (0 mana added).\n\n## Edge cases NOT covered\n- The \"beginning of your next main phase\" timing constraint (see `untestable.json`): the engine lacks a `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent`, so we cannot test that the trigger fires at the correct game phase. Instead, we directly call the trigger's effect callable to verify correctness of the mana amount and type.\n- Multiple Wizards on the battlefield — the condition is boolean (wizard present or not), so two wizards behave identically to one.\n- Mana pool emptying between phases — that's engine behavior, not card behavior.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4320,"cache_read_input_tokens":69702,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4320,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01VeYD15FWMP324ZP62Sv5vg","session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"0fd380d2-c3e5-4a36-8c66-ebc1564177fb","request_id":"req_011CbUbwCFUnssjEuweoXkmR","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Tester for sos_57"}
