{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YM4Z3vZd778zk3kK4xeBcY","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Coordinator Directives for sos_57\n2\t\n3\t## Untestable Requirement: Mana at beginning of next main phase\n4\t\n5\tThe Tester could not verify the \"beginning of your next main phase\" timing because the engine lacks a `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent`. \n6\t\n7\tPlease:\n8\t1. Add `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` to `engine/events.py` (additive only)\n9\t2. Fire this event in `engine/turn.py` at the start of PRECOMBAT_MAIN phase (and optionally POSTCOMBAT_MAIN)\n10\t3. Use this event in the card implementation for the delayed mana trigger\n11\t\n12\tThis will make the mana timing testable. The Tester will re-run after the Implementer to extend test coverage.\n13\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_011xz6oLC5Frvp92ie79V1tq","session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"b5a2d43a-e511-4a9f-bcc1-d3af9f8d3fe8","timestamp":"2026-05-28T07:53:19.423Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implementer for sos_57"}
