rom graveyard returned to battlefield\n7. -2 ability: does NOT return creature with mv>3\n8. -7 ability: loyalty goes from 3 to -4 (would need 3+ starting); flip coins mechanic (X coins heads = X turns skipped)\n\nFocus on the Observable behavior, checking loyalty changes and zone movements.\n\nWrite tests to `cards/sos/sos_97/tests.py` (path relative to workspace root /workspace/).\nOutput test-rationale.md and test-files.txt to /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/.\n\ntest-files.txt should contain the path: cards/sos/sos_97/tests.py\n\nReturn a short status summary with untestable_count."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":99,"cache_read_input_tokens":44069,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":99},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"b02e15c3-96fc-463b-8ab9-e0824f8fbb12","request_id":"req_011CbUcQtF3FfSYmDLZAEY2N"}
