{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_016fzYh8r9P9Bv527PPyyn3j","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QQzYVcHgKYs4ywXFNCAQJq","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/impl-rationale.md","content":"# Implementation Rationale: sos_97 Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer\n\n## Design Decisions\n\n### Engine Change: `turns_to_skip` attribute on `Player`\nAdded `self.turns_to_skip: int = 0` to `engine/player.py`'s `Player.__init__`. This is an additive-only change per the workspace rules. The attribute is required by the -7 ability test which checks `p2.turns_to_skip`.\n\n### Card Class\n`RalZarekGuestLecturer` subclasses `Planeswalker` (from `engine/card.py`), following the pattern established by FDN planeswalker cards (e.g., `KaitoCunningInfiltrator`, `ChandraFlameshaper`). Starting loyalty = 3, is_legendary = True (via `Supertype.LEGENDARY`), subtype = \"Ral\".\n\n### +1 Ability: Surveil 2\n- Peeks at the top 2 cards of the controller's library\n- For each card, calls `controller.choose_yes_no(...)` to decide if it goes to graveyard or stays on top\n- Cards are processed top-first; those kept on library are placed back in their relative order\n- Handles empty library gracefully (no-op)\n\n### -1 Ability: Any number of target players discard\n- Uses `pw.chosen_targets` (set externally by the test helper `_activate_loyalty_ability`)\n- For each targeted player, calls `player.choose_card(hand_cards, ...)` to select a card to discard\n- Cards are moved from hand zone directly to graveyard zone\n- Handles no targets (empty list) gracefully\n\n### -2 Ability: Reanimate creature with MV ≤ 3\n- Uses `pw.chosen_targets` for the target creature card\n- Validates: must be a `CardType.CREATURE` with `mana_cost.cmc <= 3`\n- If target fails validation (MV > 3), does nothing (card stays in graveyard)\n- Moves the creature from its current graveyard to the controller's battlefield directly\n\n### -7 Ability: Coin flip ultimatum\n- Uses `random.random()` for each of 5 coin flips: `< 0.5` = heads\n- Tests can patch `random.random` with `unittest.mock.patch` to control outcomes\n- Increments `opponent.turns_to_skip` by the number of heads\n\n## Conventions Established\n- `chosen_targets` on a planeswalker is used to pass targets into loyalty ability effects (matches existing FDN patterns)\n- Loyalty adjustment is handled by the test helper (`pw.loyalty += ability.loyalty_cost`) before calling `ability.effect(game)`, not inside the effect itself\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":123,"cache_read_input_tokens":53055,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":123,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":46,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015Xrzn5FfvWU8rwgUW3kSyV","session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"e294b2ce-969d-46c0-9686-55dc17c4cb67","request_id":"req_011CbUcteW5JQpZV34Dq4BeX","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implementer for sos_97"}
