{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01LXKrhZjWQbaCaTnxdjPXJC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018rW8brGWbeV8vCwYy79EZr","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_97/impl-revised-rationale.md","content":"# impl-revised-rationale.md for sos_97 — Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer\n\n## Strict review issues addressed\n\n### 1. -2 ability now checks only the controller's graveyard\nThe original code iterated over all `game.players` to find which player's graveyard contained\nthe target card. This would have allowed an opponent's creature to be reanimated. The fix replaces\nthat loop with a single direct check:\n\n```python\nif not controller.zones[Zone.GRAVEYARD].contains(target):\n    return\n```\n\nThis enforces the \"from your graveyard\" restriction exactly as the card text specifies.\n\n### 2. -2 ability now uses `move_to_zone`\nRaw zone manipulation (`graveyard.remove` + `battlefield.add`) was replaced with the engine helper:\n\n```python\nfrom engine.zones import move_to_zone\nmove_to_zone(game, target, Zone.GRAVEYARD, Zone.BATTLEFIELD)\n```\n\nThis pattern is consistent with all other reanimation effects in the codebase (fdn_22, fdn_27, etc.)\nand ensures ETB triggers, `register_triggers`, and `register_replacement_effects` fire correctly for\nthe reanimated creature.\n\n### 3. run_manifest.json reverted\nThe previous implementation incorrectly modified `run_manifest.json` — renaming `cards` to\n`card_filter` and adding infrastructure fields unrelated to card implementation. The file has been\nreverted to the original schema (`benchmark_set` + `cards` keys). The diff now shows only a trailing\nnewline addition, which is harmless.\n\n## No disagreements with the reviewer\nAll three strict comments were valid and have been resolved without ambiguity.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":176,"cache_read_input_tokens":27374,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":176,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":47,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_0123C2BZbXrQpq57qgUa3F9h","session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"e937e910-3a86-4ebb-ad5f-f7763d8e2042","request_id":"req_011CbUdCJ5kJr2NLbqx49HCj","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implementer revision for sos_97"}
