{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_019YNZoxQQMrPfeR5wXFsqRd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WtuBQf5WYqLHd1FfS4BMmm","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_120/test-rationale.md","content":"# Test Rationale — sos_120 Improvisation Capstone\n\n## File: `cards/sos/sos_120/tests.py`\n\n### Class: `TestImprovisationCapstoneProperties`\n\nValidates static card data against the spec (`card_spec.json`).\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_name` | Card name is \"Improvisation Capstone\" |\n| `test_is_sorcery_instance` | Card is an instance of `Sorcery` base class |\n| `test_has_sorcery_card_type` | `CardType.SORCERY` is in `card_types` |\n| `test_has_lesson_subtype` | \"Lesson\" is in `subtypes` |\n| `test_mana_cost` | Mana cost parses as `{5}{R}{R}` |\n| `test_mana_cost_cmc` | CMC is 7 (5 generic + 2 red pips) |\n| `test_not_a_creature` | Negative: not a creature |\n| `test_not_an_instant` | Negative: not an instant (sorcery only) |\n\n### Class: `TestImprovisationCapstoneLibraryExile`\n\nValidates the main effect's \"exile from top until total MV >= 4\" mechanic.\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_exiles_until_total_mv_reaches_4` | Two 2-CMC cards: both exiled (2+2=4 ≥ 4) |\n| `test_stops_exiling_once_mv_threshold_met` | A single 5-CMC card satisfies threshold; card below stays in library |\n| `test_exiles_multiple_low_mv_cards_until_threshold` | Three 2-CMC cards: only first two exiled (total=4), third stays |\n| `test_exiles_from_controller_library_not_opponent` | Only controller's library is touched |\n| `test_empty_library_does_not_raise` | Resolution with empty library must not raise (graceful no-op) |\n| `test_exiled_cards_removed_from_library` | Cards exiled must no longer be present in the library zone |\n\nEdge cases covered:\n- Single card exceeding threshold (does not over-exile)\n- Exactly-meets-threshold (boundary condition at total = 4)\n- Empty library (error safety)\n- Zone isolation (opponent's library untouched)\n\nEdge cases NOT covered:\n- Lands exiled from library (spec is ambiguous whether 0-MV lands count toward total; deferred to implementation convention)\n- Cards with X in their cost (CMC = 0 for X; would they ever be part of the total?)\n\n### Class: `TestImprovisationCapstoneFreeCast`\n\nValidates that exiled cards are available for free casting.\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_exiled_spells_can_be_cast_for_free` | After resolution, exiled cards are no longer in the library (they were offered/cast) |\n| `test_on_resolve_does_not_put_exiled_cards_in_graveyard` | Exiled-from-library cards must not end up in graveyard on resolution |\n\nNote: Full \"cast for free\" verification (asserting the actual card was cast and placed on the stack/battlefield) is partially untestable because it depends on `player.choose_yes_no` and `player.choose` scripted answers. `DeterministicPlayer` in the test harness uses default answers, so we can only assert what we know deterministically. See `untestable.json` for details.\n\n### Class: `TestImprovisationCapstoneParadigmExile`\n\nValidates that the Paradigm mechanic causes the spell to be exiled (not graveyarded) after resolving.\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_spell_not_in_graveyard_after_resolution` | The card is not in the graveyard after `on_resolve` |\n| `test_spell_in_exile_after_resolution` | The card is in the exile zone after `on_resolve` (when in stack zone first) |\n| `test_second_resolution_spell_also_in_exile` | A second copy that resolves is also exiled |\n\n### Class: `TestImprovisationCapstoneParadigmFlag`\n\nValidates the `has_paradigm_triggered` flag used to track first-ever resolution.\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_has_paradigm_triggered_false_before_resolution` | Fresh card has the flag as False/absent |\n| `test_has_paradigm_triggered_true_after_resolution` | After `on_resolve`, flag is `True` |\n| `test_has_paradigm_triggered_persists_across_resolutions` | Flag stays True through subsequent resolutions |\n\n### Class: `TestImprovisationCapstoneParadigmTrigger`\n\nValidates the recurring beginning-of-main-phase trigger set up by the Paradigm mechanic.\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_trigger_registered_after_first_resolution` | At least one trigger is registered after resolution |\n| `test_trigger_watches_beginning_of_main_phase_event` | Trigger watches `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` |\n| `test_trigger_controller_is_spell_controller` | Trigger controller is the spell's caster (p1) |\n| `test_trigger_condition_fires_for_precombat_main` | Condition evaluates True for `PRECOMBAT_MAIN` of the controller |\n| `test_trigger_condition_does_not_fire_for_opponent_main_phase` | Condition evaluates False for opponent's main phase |\n| `test_trigger_fires_into_stack_when_event_raised` | Firing the event actually pushes a stack object |\n\n## Untestable / Partially Testable Items\n\nSee `/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_120/untestable.json` for two items that cannot be fully verified with the current engine surface area.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5601,"cache_read_input_tokens":45298,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5601,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01U4cYF49JRGR9TT1iZ5VVWR","session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"78288ba7-9f04-4c49-b065-de7f837ca1e8","request_id":"req_011CbUdTJMHpyFeQuQXu2299","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Tester for sos_120"}
