orcery — Lesson with mana cost {5}{R}{R}.\n\nMain effect: Exile cards from the top of your library until you exile cards with total mana value 4 or greater. You may cast any number of spells from among them without paying their mana costs.\n\nParadigm mechanic: Then exile this spell. After you first resolve a spell with this name, you may cast a copy of it from exile without paying its mana cost at the beginning of each of your first main phases.\n\nThe Paradigm mechanic means:\n1. After first resolution, the spell is exiled (not put to graveyard)\n2. At the beginning of each of your first main phases (PRECOMBAT_MAIN), you may cast a copy of the spell for free from exile (the original stays in exile)\n3. This is a recurring ability\n\nFocus your tests on:\n1. Card static properties (Sorcery type, Lesson subtype, name, mana cost)\n2. Main effect: exile cards from top of library until total mv >= 4\n3. Main effect: the controller can cast exiled spells for free\n4. Paradigm: after resolving, this spell is exiled (not in graveyard)\n5. Paradigm: has_paradigm_triggered flag (first resolution sets it)\n6. Paradigm: after first resolution, has ability to cast copy at beginning of main phase\n\nWrite tests to `cards/sos/sos_120/tests.py` (path relative to workspace root /workspace/).\nOutput test-rationale.md and test-files.txt to /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_120/.\n\ntest-files.txt should contain the path: cards/sos/sos_120/tests.py\n\nReturn a short status summary with untestable_count.","agentId":"a39dffd238af11516","agentType":"Tester","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All files are in place. Here is the status summary:\n\n```\nTESTS_WRITTEN\ntest_files: 1\ntest_cases: 28\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_120/test-rationale.md\nfiles_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_120/test-files.txt\nuntestable_count: 2\nuntestable_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_120/untestable.json\nnotes: wrote 28 test cases for sos_120 Improvisation Capstone across 5 test classes covering static 