{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_0138eciNho7CbystSYB5CqiW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01J89kP6WKfKk9hv7eivC3ju","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/test-rationale.md","content":"# Test Rationale — sos_201 Lorehold, the Historian\n\n## File: `cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py`\n\n### Class `TestLoreholdStaticProperties`\n\nValidates every concrete static field on the card object before any game logic runs.\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_name` | Card name is \"Lorehold, the Historian\" |\n| `test_is_creature` | CardType.CREATURE in card_types; inherits from Creature |\n| `test_mana_cost` | Mana cost parses as {3}{R}{W} |\n| `test_power` | base_power == 5 |\n| `test_toughness` | base_toughness == 5 |\n| `test_has_flying` | Keyword.FLYING present |\n| `test_has_haste` | Keyword.HASTE present |\n| `test_is_legendary` | Supertype.LEGENDARY in supertypes |\n| `test_is_elder_dragon` | Subtypes include \"Elder\" and \"Dragon\" |\n| `test_colors_include_red` | Mana cost contains a red pip |\n| `test_colors_include_white` | Mana cost contains a white pip |\n\n### Class `TestLoreholdMiracleCostGrant`\n\nTests the miracle-cost granting ability. The spec says \"each instant and sorcery card in your hand has miracle {2}.\" The implementation must expose `get_miracle_cost(card)` returning `ManaCost.parse(\"{2}\")` for instants/sorceries and `None` for everything else.\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_get_miracle_cost_returns_callable_or_manacost` | The method `get_miracle_cost` exists on the class |\n| `test_instant_in_hand_has_miracle_cost_two` | Instant cards get miracle {2} |\n| `test_sorcery_in_hand_has_miracle_cost_two` | Sorcery cards get miracle {2} |\n| `test_creature_does_not_get_miracle_cost` | Creature cards return None |\n| `test_miracle_cost_not_granted_to_opponent_cards` | Miracle only applies to the controller's cards |\n\n**Edge cases not covered:**\n- Full miracle cast pipeline (draw-first-this-turn → cast-for-miracle-cost): the engine has no miracle cast mechanic at all. We test only that the card correctly identifies which cards qualify and what cost they get. This is logged in `untestable.json`.\n\n### Class `TestLoreholdOpponentUpkeepTriggerRegistration`\n\nVerifies that `register_triggers` registers at least one `BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent` trigger with `lorehold` as the source.\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_registers_upkeep_trigger_on_battlefield` | A BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent trigger is registered |\n| `test_trigger_source_is_lorehold` | The registered trigger's source is the Lorehold card |\n\n### Class `TestLoreholdOpponentUpkeepTriggerFiring`\n\nVerifies the trigger condition: it must fire on opponent's upkeep but NOT on the controller's own upkeep.\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_trigger_does_not_fire_on_controllers_own_upkeep` | Stack unchanged when p1 is active (controller's own upkeep) |\n| `test_trigger_fires_on_opponents_upkeep` | Stack grows when p2 is active (opponent's upkeep) |\n\n### Class `TestLoreholdDiscardDrawEffect`\n\nTests the trigger resolution: \"you may discard a card. If you do, draw a card.\"\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_discarding_results_in_drawing_a_card` | Discard+draw keeps net hand size the same |\n| `test_discarded_card_goes_to_graveyard` | The discarded card ends up in the graveyard |\n| `test_declining_to_discard_means_no_draw` | Saying no to discard means hand size unchanged |\n| `test_declining_to_discard_does_not_attempt_library_draw` | Declining does not trip drawn_from_empty_library |\n\n**Edge cases not covered:**\n- Empty hand when the trigger fires (no card to discard): the spec says \"you may discard a card\" — with nothing to discard, the effect is a no-op. Not explicitly tested because DeterministicPlayer with `[False]` already covers the \"no draw\" path; a separate empty-hand test would be largely identical.\n- Multiple opponents (not applicable: the engine is two-player only).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4532,"cache_read_input_tokens":44324,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4532,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01RGCd9dZX3bnKjwtNkPpxgY","session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"4f2af32b-c935-42c8-be18-9014833993b9","request_id":"req_011CbUeFAbkBkTfZdSq6kJFw","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Tester for sos_201"}
