word abilities)\n2. Each instant and sorcery card in your hand has miracle {2}. \n   (Miracle: You may cast a card for its miracle cost when you draw it if it's the first card you drew this turn.)\n   So each instant/sorcery in hand has miracle cost {2} (colorless)\n3. At the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, you may discard a card. If you do, draw a card.\n\nFocus tests on:\n1. Card static properties (name, power=5, toughness=5, FLYING and HASTE keywords, LEGENDARY)\n2. Has correct card_types (CREATURE) and colors\n3. Miracle ability grant: method `get_miracle_cost(card)` or equivalent that returns {2} for instants/sorceries in hand, None for others\n4. OR test the property on the dragon itself that indicates instants/sorceries in hand have miracle {2}\n5. Opponent upkeep trigger: at beginning of each opponent's upkeep, may discard a card to draw a card\n6. Upkeep trigger fires for opponent upkeep, not your own\n7. Discard+draw effect: if discard happens, draw 1 card\n\nWrite tests to `cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py` (path relative to workspace root /workspace/).\nOutput test-rationale.md and test-files.txt to /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/.\n\ntest-files.txt should contain the path: cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py\n\nReturn a short status summary with untestable_count.","agentId":"ac298fbf2e3baf4ee","agentType":"Tester","content":[{"type":"text","text":"24 test cases, all under the 30-test limit.\n\n---\n\n```\nTESTS_WRITTEN\ntest_files: 1\ntest_cases: 24\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/test-rationale.md\nfiles_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/test-files.txt\nuntestable_count: 1\nuntestable_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/untestable.json\nnotes: wrote 24 test cases for sos_201 Lorehold, the Historian across 5 test classes covering static properties, miracle-cost grant API, opponent-upkeep trigger registration/firing, and discard-then-draw effect\n```"}],"totalDurationMs":177617,"totalTokens":51339,"totalToolUseCount":40,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache