{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01Vgjqs3CWuUkAem2F3BzxrG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01YEW8Xm1V4HqaHoukc7cjQ5","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/coordinator-directives.md","content":"# Coordinator Directives for sos_201\n\n## Untestable Requirement: Miracle cast pipeline\n\nThe Tester could not test the miracle cast pipeline (offering cast at miracle cost when first card is drawn this turn) because the engine lacks this infrastructure.\n\nPlease implement:\n1. Track \"first card drawn this turn\" per player. Add a `cards_drawn_this_turn: int = 0` attribute to the Player class (if not already present) and reset it at the start of each player's turn.\n2. When a card is drawn, if it is the first card drawn this turn (cards_drawn_this_turn == 0 before incrementing), check if any permanent controlled by that player grants miracle to that card.\n3. The check: iterate game.battlefield for the player's permanents, check if they implement `get_miracle_cost(card)` → if it returns a ManaCost (not None), offer the player a choice to cast it at that miracle cost.\n4. This can be done via a hook in the draw logic (engine/zones.py or engine/turn.py).\n\nFor Lorehold, implement `get_miracle_cost(card)` that returns ManaCost({2}) for any instant or sorcery card (checking card.card_types for CardType.INSTANT or CardType.SORCERY).\n\nNote: This engine change is additive only (don't rename/delete existing things).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":388,"cache_read_input_tokens":58688,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":388},"output_tokens":23,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942