gm trigger deduplication\"\n38\t        }\n39\t      ]\n40\t    },\n41\t    {\n42\t      \"card\": \"sos_13\",\n43\t      \"tests\": [\n44\t        {\n45\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py\",\n46\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_13 Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares: static properties, ETB trigger registration/effect (Inkling token creation), prepared mechanic state, and cast_prepared_spell (exile + life gain using current power)\"\n47\t        }\n48\t      ],\n49\t      \"implementation\": [\n50\t        {\n51\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_13/card_impl.py\",\n52\t          \"summary\": \"EmeritusOfTruceSwordsToPlowshares: revised cast_prepared_spell to use current in-game power (getattr power fallback to base_power) instead of base_power for life gain, per Swords to Plowshares rule 701.13a\"\n53\t        }\n54\t      ]\n55\t    },\n56\t    {\n57\t      \"card\": \"sos_4\",\n58\t      \"tests\": [\n59\t        {\n60\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_4/tests.py\",\n61\t          \"summary\": \"Tests for sos_4 Together as One: static properties, colors_spent converge attribute, on_resolve with X=0/1/3/5, creature vs player damage, life gain to controller\"\n62\t        }\n63\t      ],\n64\t      \"implementation\": [\n65\t        {\n66\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_4/card_impl.py\",\n67\t          \"summary\": \"TogetherAsOne: Sorcery with colors_spent, on_resolve draws X cards, deals X damage, controller gains X life with GainsLifeTriggeredEvent fired\"\n68\t        }\n69\t      ]\n70\t    },\n71\t    {\n72\t      \"card\": \"sos_57\",\n73\t      \"tests\": [\n74\t        {\n75\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py\",\n76\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_57 Mana Sculpt: static properties, counterspell effect (removes from stack), Wizard conditional for delayed mana trigger registration, and mana amount equal to countered spell's CMC\"\n77\t        }\n78\t      ],\n79\t      \"implementation\": [\n80\t        {\n81\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_57/card_impl.py\",\n82\t          \"summary\": \"ManaSculpt: Instant that counters target spell from stack and registers a one-shot BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent trigger for colorless mana equal to countered spell's CMC if controller has a Wizard\"\n83\t        },\n84\t        {\n85\t          \"path\": \"engine/events.py\",\n86\t          \"summary\": \"Added BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent dataclass with active_player and phase fields\"\n87\t        },\n88\t        {\n89\t          \"path\": \"engine/turn.py\",\n90\t          \"summary\": \"Fire BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent at the start of PRECOMBAT_MAIN and POSTCOMBAT_MAIN phases in run_turn()\"\n91\t        }\n92\t      ]\n93\t    },\n94\t    {\n95\t      \"card\": \"sos_97\",\n96\t      \"tests\": [\n97\t        {\n98\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_97/tests.py\",\n99\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_97 Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer: static properties, +1 surveil 2, -1 any-number-of-players discard, -2 reanimate creature mv<=3 from controller-only graveyard, -7 coin-flip turn-skip ultimatum\"\n100\t        }\n101\t      ],\n102\t      \"implementation\": [\n103\t        {\n104\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_97/card_impl.py\",\n105\t          \"summary\": \"RalZarekGuestLecturer: -2 now restricts to controller's graveyard only and uses move_to_zone for correct ETB/trigger firing; +1 surveil-2, -1 multi-target discard, -7 coin-flip turn-skip\"\n106\t        },\n107\t        {\n108\t          \"path\": \"engine/player.py\",\n109\t          \"summary\": \"Added turns_to_skip: int = 0 attribute to Player.__init__ for turn-skip tracking\"\n110\t        }\n111\t      ]\n112\t    }\n113\t  ]\n114\t}\n115\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01DP2RdqbrfsfPsqCKX79yjE","session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"5825123c-1177-495c-9ef5-3f4dfdb7d66f","timestamp":"2026-05-28T08:23:32.468Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description"