{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017Rrd6W3LgXJ1uB5r5gEBuQ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Coordinator Directives for sos_201\n2\t\n3\t## Untestable Requirement: Miracle cast pipeline\n4\t\n5\tThe Tester could not test the miracle cast pipeline (offering cast at miracle cost when first card is drawn this turn) because the engine lacks this infrastructure.\n6\t\n7\tPlease implement:\n8\t1. Track \"first card drawn this turn\" per player. Add a `cards_drawn_this_turn: int = 0` attribute to the Player class (if not already present) and reset it at the start of each player's turn.\n9\t2. When a card is drawn, if it is the first card drawn this turn (cards_drawn_this_turn == 0 before incrementing), check if any permanent controlled by that player grants miracle to that card.\n10\t3. The check: iterate game.battlefield for the player's permanents, check if they implement `get_miracle_cost(card)` → if it returns a ManaCost (not None), offer the player a choice to cast it at that miracle cost.\n11\t4. This can be done via a hook in the draw logic (engine/zones.py or engine/turn.py).\n12\t\n13\tFor Lorehold, implement `get_miracle_cost(card)` that returns ManaCost({2}) for any instant or sorcery card (checking card.card_types for CardType.INSTANT or CardType.SORCERY).\n14\t\n15\tNote: This engine change is additive only (don't rename/delete existing things).\n16\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01DP2RdqbrfsfPsqCKX79yjE","session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"c82c97f4-fbb1-4ced-91e2-eda36e86ee0c","timestamp":"2026-05-28T08:30:48.591Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implementer for sos_201"}
