ur hand has miracle {2}.\n   (You may cast a card for its miracle cost when you draw it if it's the first card you drew this turn.)\n3. At the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, you may discard a card. If you do, draw a card.\n\nENGINE CHANGES NEEDED (from coordinator-directives.md):\n- Add `cards_drawn_this_turn: int = 0` to Player class (if not present)\n- Reset this counter at start of each player's turn\n- When a card is drawn (first card this turn), check battlefield permanents for `get_miracle_cost(card)` and offer miracle cast option\n- This is additive only\n\nCARD IMPLEMENTATION:\n1. LoreholdTheHistorian extends Creature\n2. name = \"Lorehold, the Historian\"\n3. base_power = 5, base_toughness = 5\n4. keywords = [Keyword.FLYING, Keyword.HASTE]\n5. is_legendary = True\n6. colors = {ManaType.RED, ManaType.WHITE}\n7. Implement `get_miracle_cost(card)` method:\n   - Returns ManaCost({2}) if card.card_types includes CardType.INSTANT or CardType.SORCERY\n   - Returns None otherwise\n8. Trigger: at beginning of each OPPONENT's upkeep (BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent where event.player != self.controller):\n   - Effect: controller may discard a card (choose_yes_no)\n   - If yes: controller discards 1 card, then draws 1 card\n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n- Make ALL tests in cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py pass.\n- Do NOT modify the test file.\n- Write output to /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/impl.diff, impl-rationale.md, impl-files.txt\n- Upsert this card's entry into /workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json\n\nReturn either:\nIMPL_DONE\nfiles_changed: N\ntests_passing: all\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/impl.diff\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/impl-rationale.md\nnotes: one-line summary\n\nOR:\nDISPUTE\ntests_failing: N\ndisputed_tests: list\ndispute_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/test-dispute.md\nnotes: one-line summary","agentId":"a90a1c39ad1f39d5b","agentType":"Implementer","content":[{"type":"text","text":"IMPL_DONE\nfiles_changed: 3\ntests_passing: all\ndiff_