en self.controller is None, it falls through and grants miracle to any instant/sorcery\n   - Fix: Add `if ctrl is None: return None` before any card_ctrl check\n   - Then: `if card_ctrl is not None and ctrl is not card_ctrl: return None`\n\n2. (engine/player.py line ~39) The `cards_drawn_this_turn` counter is never reset at start of turn.\n   - In engine/turn.py, at the start of each player's turn (in the untap step or at the top of run_turn), add `player.cards_drawn_this_turn = 0` to reset it.\n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n- Apply ALL strict review comments.\n- Do NOT modify the test file.\n- Write output to /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/impl-revised.diff, impl-revised-rationale.md\n- Update FILES_MODIFIED.json entry for sos_201 in place.\n\nReturn:\nREVISION_DONE\ndisagreement_count: N\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/impl-revised.diff\ndisagreements_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/disagreements.json","agentId":"a25076e1e475ac07e","agentType":"Implementer","content":[{"type":"text","text":"REVISION_DONE\ndisagreement_count: 0\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/impl-revised.diff\ndisagreements_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_201/disagreements.json\n\n**Changes made:**\n\n1. `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py` — Fixed `get_miracle_cost` controller guard: added `if ctrl is None: return None` early exit before the card-controller check, then simplified the remaining guard to `if card_ctrl is not None and ctrl is not card_ctrl: return None`. An uncontrolled permanent can no longer accidentally grant miracle to opponent cards.\n\n2. `/workspace/engine/turn.py` — Added `active.cards_drawn_this_turn = 0` inside `_do_untap_step`, alongside the existing `land_plays_remaining` reset. This ensures the miracle \"first draw of turn\" counter resets correctly at the start of each player's turn.\n\nAll 24 `sos_201` tests pass, and the full suite (1365 tests) is clean."}],"totalDurationMs":72024,"totalTokens":25710,"totalToolUseCount":16,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache