{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_015WE1bkmihhEsqQgjTk7uot","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01S4fNW57avaPadQXpKSq7YV","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Tester for sos_226","subagent_type":"Tester","prompt":"Write pytest tests for the SOS card sos_226 (Silverquill, the Disputant).\n\nCard spec path: /workspace/cards/sos/sos_226/card_spec.json\nCard impl stub: /workspace/cards/sos/sos_226/card_impl.py\nOutput directory: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226/\n\nKey files for context:\n- AGENTS.md: /workspace/AGENTS.md\n- PROJECT_MAP.md: /workspace/PROJECT_MAP.md\n- KEY_DECISIONS.md: /workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md\n- FILES_MODIFIED.json: /workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json\n- test_utils reference: /workspace/test_utils.md\n- Example test files: /workspace/cards/fdn/fdn_13/tests.py, /workspace/cards/fdn/fdn_142/tests.py, /workspace/cards/fdn/fdn_205/tests.py\n- Engine source: /workspace/engine/card.py, /workspace/engine/events.py, /workspace/engine/triggers.py\n\nCARD DESCRIPTION:\nSilverquill, the Disputant is a 4/4 Legendary Creature — Elder Dragon (white/black) with mana cost {2}{W}{B}.\n\nAbilities:\n1. Flying, Vigilance (keyword abilities)\n2. Each instant and sorcery spell you cast has casualty 1.\n   Casualty N: As you cast that spell, you may sacrifice a creature with power N or greater. When you do, copy the spell and you may choose new targets for the copy.\n\nThe casualty mechanic grant means:\n- When casting any instant or sorcery while Silverquill is on the battlefield, the caster may sacrifice a creature with power 1 or greater\n- If they do, a copy of the spell is created and may have new targets chosen\n\nFocus tests on:\n1. Card static properties (name, power=4, toughness=4, FLYING and VIGILANCE keywords, LEGENDARY)\n2. Has correct card_types (CREATURE) and colors  \n3. The get_casualty_value(card) or grants_casualty(card) method that returns 1 for instants/sorceries\n4. Casualty implementation: controller may sacrifice a creature with power>=1 to copy the spell\n5. When casualty triggers: original spell + copy both resolve\n6. No casualty when no eligible creature exists or player declines\n\nWrite tests to `cards/sos/sos_226/tests.py` (path relative to workspace root /workspace/).\nOutput test-rationale.md and test-files.txt to /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226/.\n\ntest-files.txt should contain the path: cards/sos/sos_226/tests.py\n\nReturn a short status summary with untestable_count."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":99,"cache_read_input_tokens":64182,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":99},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"dac60d76-f02b-4b66-bf19-3af30183d8e1","request_id":"req_011CbUfPayHruUiiq1uknJft"}
