gm trigger deduplication\"\n38\t        }\n39\t      ]\n40\t    },\n41\t    {\n42\t      \"card\": \"sos_13\",\n43\t      \"tests\": [\n44\t        {\n45\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py\",\n46\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_13 Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares: static properties, ETB trigger registration/effect (Inkling token creation), prepared mechanic state, and cast_prepared_spell (exile + life gain using current power)\"\n47\t        }\n48\t      ],\n49\t      \"implementation\": [\n50\t        {\n51\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_13/card_impl.py\",\n52\t          \"summary\": \"EmeritusOfTruceSwordsToPlowshares: revised cast_prepared_spell to use current in-game power (getattr power fallback to base_power) instead of base_power for life gain, per Swords to Plowshares rule 701.13a\"\n53\t        }\n54\t      ]\n55\t    },\n56\t    {\n57\t      \"card\": \"sos_201\",\n58\t      \"tests\": [\n59\t        {\n60\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py\",\n61\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_201 Lorehold the Historian: static properties, miracle cost grant for instants/sorceries, opponent upkeep trigger registration/firing, discard-then-draw effect, and decline-to-discard behavior\"\n62\t        }\n63\t      ],\n64\t      \"implementation\": [\n65\t        {\n66\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py\",\n67\t          \"summary\": \"LoreholdTheHistorian: fixed get_miracle_cost controller guard (early return when ctrl is None; correct identity check otherwise)\"\n68\t        },\n69\t        {\n70\t          \"path\": \"engine/player.py\",\n71\t          \"summary\": \"Added cards_drawn_this_turn: int = 0 attribute to Player.__init__ for miracle draw tracking\"\n72\t        },\n73\t        {\n74\t          \"path\": \"engine/stack.py\",\n75\t          \"summary\": \"Added size() method to Stack class as alias for __len__\"\n76\t        },\n77\t        {\n78\t          \"path\": \"engine/turn.py\",\n79\t          \"summary\": \"Reset active.cards_drawn_this_turn = 0 in _do_untap_step so miracle tracking resets each turn\"\n80\t        }\n81\t      ]\n82\t    },\n83\t    {\n84\t      \"card\": \"sos_226\",\n85\t      \"tests\": [\n86\t        {\n87\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_226/tests.py\",\n88\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_226 Silverquill the Disputant: static properties, get_casualty_value API (instant/sorcery=1, other=None, opponent/uncontrolled=None), and _apply_casualty_for_spell mechanic (sacrifice, copy on stack, decline, no eligible creature)\"\n89\t        }\n90\t      ],\n91\t      \"implementation\": [\n92\t        {\n93\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_226/card_impl.py\",\n94\t          \"summary\": \"SilverquillTheDisputant: Creature with FLYING+VIGILANCE, get_casualty_value returns 1 for controller's instants/sorceries, _apply_casualty_for_spell sacrifices eligible creature and pushes copy to stack\"\n95\t        }\n96\t      ]\n97\t    },\n98\t    {\n99\t      \"card\": \"sos_4\",\n100\t      \"tests\": [\n101\t        {\n102\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_4/tests.py\",\n103\t          \"summary\": \"Tests for sos_4 Together as One: static properties, colors_spent converge attribute, on_resolve with X=0/1/3/5, creature vs player damage, life gain to controller\"\n104\t        }\n105\t      ],\n106\t      \"implementation\": [\n107\t        {\n108\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_4/card_impl.py\",\n109\t          \"summary\": \"TogetherAsOne: Sorcery with colors_spent, on_resolve draws X cards, deals X damage, controller gains X life with GainsLifeTriggeredEvent fired\"\n110\t        }\n111\t      ]\n112\t    },\n113\t    {\n114\t      \"card\": \"sos_57\",\n115\t      \"tests\": [\n116\t        {\n117\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py\",\n118\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_57 Mana Sculpt: static properties, counterspell effect (removes from stack), Wizard conditional for delayed mana trigger registration, and mana amount equal to countered spell's CMC\"\n119\t        }\n120\t      ],\n121\t      \"implementation\": [\n122\t        {\n123\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_57/card_impl.py\",\n124\t          \"summary\": \"ManaSculpt: Instant that counters target spell from stack and registers a one-shot BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent trigger for colorless mana equal to countered spell's CMC if controller has a Wizard\"\n125\t        },\n126\t        {\n127\t          \"path\": \"engine/events.py\",\n128\t          \"summary\": \"Added BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent dataclass with active_player and phase fields\"\n129\t        },\n130\t        {\n131\t          \"path\": \"engine/turn.py\",\n132\t          \"summary\": \"Fire BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent at the start of PRECOMBAT_MAIN and POSTCOMBAT_MAIN phases in run_turn()\"\n133\t        }\n134\t      ]\n135\t    },\n136\t    {\n137\t      \"card\": \"sos_97\",\n138\t      \"tests\": [\n139\t        {\n140\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_97/tests.py\",\n141\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_97 Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer: static properties, +1 surveil 2, -1 any-number-of-players discard, -2 reanimate creature mv<=3 from controller-only graveyard, -7 coin-flip turn-skip ultimatum\"\n142\t        }\n143\t      ],\n144\t      \"implementation\": [\n145\t        {\n146\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_97/card_impl.py\",\n147\t          \"summary\": \"RalZarekGuestLecturer: -2 now restricts to controller's graveyard only and uses move_to_zone for correct ETB/trigger firing; +1 surveil-2, -1 multi-target discard, -7 coin-flip turn-skip\"\n148\t        },\n149\t        {\n150\t          \"path\": \"engine/player.py\",\n151\t          \"summary\": \"Added turns_to_skip: int = 0 attribute to Player.__init__ for turn-skip tracking\"\n152\t        }\n153\t      ]\n154\t    }\n155\t  ]\n156\t}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_013GMMo4o7cVm3wshUdH1isZ","session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e