{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01JRstyRCM8t3CaKupKijezd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Fgerequ9qxd5J2TVXmtMNu","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Implementer revision for sos_226","subagent_type":"Implementer","prompt":"Revise the implementation of SOS card sos_226 (Silverquill, the Disputant) to address strict reviewer comments.\n\nImplementation file: /workspace/cards/sos/sos_226/card_impl.py\nTests file: /workspace/cards/sos/sos_226/tests.py (DO NOT MODIFY)\nReview comments: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226/review.json\nFILES_MODIFIED.json: /workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json\nEngine source: /workspace/engine/card.py, /workspace/engine/casting.py, /workspace/engine/stack.py, /workspace/engine/triggers.py, /workspace/engine/events.py\n\nSTRICT ISSUES TO FIX:\n\n1. (line ~151) The _apply_casualty_for_spell is never hooked into the casting pipeline. Fix: Override `on_cast(self, game, spell)` method in SilverquillTheDisputant. This method should be called whenever a spell is being cast. In on_cast:\n   - Check if the spell is an instant or sorcery (CardType.INSTANT or CardType.SORCERY in spell.card_types)\n   - Check if spell's controller matches self.controller\n   - If both match, call _apply_casualty_for_spell(game, spell)\n   Look at how the engine calls on_cast hooks or use register_triggers to listen for spell cast events.\n\n2. (line ~98) Fix the controller resolution: use only `spell.controller` as the primary source. Only fall back if spell.controller is actually None (not as an \"or\" fallback that silently switches). Don't apply casualty if spell controller doesn't match self.controller.\n\n3. (line ~142) Use the engine's established `copy_spell(game, original_stack_obj, ctrl)` utility from engine/stack.py instead of `copy.copy(spell)`. This avoids shared mutable state issues.\n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n- Apply ALL strict review comments.\n- Do NOT modify the test file.\n- Ensure all 25 tests still pass after the changes.\n- Write output to /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226/impl-revised.diff, impl-revised-rationale.md\n- Update FILES_MODIFIED.json entry for sos_226 in place.\n\nReturn:\nREVISION_DONE\ndisagreement_count: N\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226/impl-revised.diff\ndisagreements_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_226/disagreements.json"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":981,"cache_read_input_tokens":67716,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":981},"output_tokens":65,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"ad92e3e7-8710-4f32-8b46-430d45515fe8","request_id":"req_011CbUfvMKsJLwAusRr8c9XS"}
