cast`` hook.\n273\t    5. Push a :class:`StackObject` whose ``on_resolve`` callback handles\n274\t       resolution normally (permanents → battlefield, non-permanents →"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Fgerequ9qxd5J2TVXmtMNu","session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"47d30332-0b15-4c1b-b5ea-a7744e973913","timestamp":"2026-05-28T08:45:47.062Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implementer revision for sos_226"}
