{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_016LjYUbng1Ek3uWy2Ycb3UZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DNTCfxfKz7KTJyVTbNPu1D","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_245/impl-rationale.md","content":"# impl-rationale.md — sos_245 Witherbloom, the Balancer\n\n## Design decisions\n\n### Class hierarchy\n`WitherbloomTheBalancer` extends `Creature` directly, following the same pattern as `SilverquillTheDisputant` (sos_226) and other Elder Dragon implementations.\n\n### Affinity for creatures — `cost_reduction(game)`\nThe method delegates to a shared helper `_count_controller_creatures(game)` that:\n- Guards against `controller is None` (returns 0 safely)\n- Calls `game.get_battlefield(ctrl).get_all()` and counts cards with `CardType.CREATURE` in their `card_types`\n- Counts all creatures including Witherbloom itself when it is on the battlefield (correct per rules — affinity counts permanents already in play, not the card being cast)\n\n### Granting affinity to instants/sorceries — `get_affinity_cost_reduction(spell, game)`\nThis exposes the method name exactly as the tests expect: `get_affinity_cost_reduction(spell, game)` (spell first, game second — matching the test call signatures at lines 239, 250, etc.).\n\nGuards applied in order:\n1. `self.controller is None` → return 0 (uncontrolled, no grant)\n2. `spell.controller is not ctrl` → return 0 (opponent's spell)\n3. `CardType.INSTANT not in card_types and CardType.SORCERY not in card_types` → return 0 (non-eligible spell type)\n4. Otherwise return `_count_controller_creatures(game)`\n\n### Static properties\nAll set via `kwargs.setdefault(...)` in `__init__`, following the established FDN/SOS pattern:\n- `name = \"Witherbloom, the Balancer\"`\n- `mana_cost = ManaCost.parse(\"{6}{B}{G}\")`\n- `supertypes = {Supertype.LEGENDARY}`\n- `subtypes = {\"Elder\", \"Dragon\"}`\n- `keywords = Keyword.FLYING | Keyword.DEATHTOUCH`\n- `base_power = 5`, `base_toughness = 5`\n\n## Conventions established\n- Same `_count_controller_creatures` helper pattern can be reused by future affinity-for-creatures cards.\n- Method signature `get_affinity_cost_reduction(spell, game)` follows the KEY_DECISIONS miracle pattern (`get_miracle_cost(card)`) but includes `game` since creature count requires battlefield inspection.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":87,"cache_read_input_tokens":35075,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":87,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":53,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01X8orE9WxHdL5WPGzSBonbq","session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"3b4ff577-2d5b-4dfd-b9e1-ac68cdfc256f","request_id":"req_011CbUgaPsE7AStpXpPvTKmT","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implementer for sos_245"}
