{"type":"system","subtype":"task_progress","task_id":"ad08e41ac3594e32e","tool_use_id":"toolu_01WCFp6ydLbtYch5PGnC6zGM","description":"Writing /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/test-rationale.md","subagent_type":"Tester","usage":{"total_tokens":59550,"tool_uses":38,"duration_ms":166193},"last_tool_name":"Write","uuid":"cba54cb5-4955-470a-98c2-a0e17c69a8a4","session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01TJytFQznVZ8JfFPGLr4bjH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01J5XvhE85q7xwfdQLT6hAus","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/test-rationale.md","content":"# Test Rationale — sos_257 Great Hall of the Biblioplex\n\n## File: `cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py`\n\n### TestGreatHallProperties — Static card properties\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_name` | Card name is \"Great Hall of the Biblioplex\" |\n| `test_is_land_subclass` | Class inherits from `Land` |\n| `test_has_land_card_type` | `CardType.LAND` is in `card_types` |\n| `test_no_mana_cost` | Lands have no mana cost (empty `ManaCost`) |\n| `test_is_not_creature_initially` | `CardType.CREATURE` is absent before any activation |\n| `test_no_power_toughness_initially` | No creature stats before transformation |\n\n### TestGreatHallManaAbilities — Tap-for-mana abilities\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_returns_two_mana_abilities` | Exactly two mana abilities declared |\n| `test_each_ability_is_mana_ability` | Both entries are `ManaAbility` instances |\n| `test_colorless_ability_adds_colorless_mana` | `{T}: Add {C}` — colorless mana added to pool |\n| `test_colorless_ability_taps_source` | Cost taps the land |\n| `test_colorless_ability_fails_if_already_tapped` | Can't re-tap (cost returns False) |\n| `test_life_ability_pays_one_life` | `{T}, Pay 1 life` — controller loses 1 life |\n| `test_life_ability_taps_source` | Life ability also taps the land |\n| `test_life_ability_produces_a_colored_mana` | Any-color mana is added to pool (restricted to instant/sorcery use) |\n\n**Edge cases not covered (and why):**\n- The \"Spend this mana only to cast an instant or sorcery spell\" restriction is a spending restriction the engine tracks at cast-time, not at production time. The engine currently doesn't enforce spending restrictions on specific mana (see `untestable.json`). We verify the mana is produced but cannot verify the restriction is enforced.\n\n### TestGreatHallCreatureTransformation — {5} activated ability\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_get_activated_abilities_returns_at_least_one` | `get_activated_abilities()` returns at least one ability |\n| `test_activate_creature_ability_adds_creature_type` | After activation, `CardType.CREATURE` added |\n| `test_still_a_land_after_transformation` | `CardType.LAND` remains after transformation (\"It's still a land\") |\n| `test_power_is_2_after_transformation` | Creature has base power 2 |\n| `test_toughness_is_4_after_transformation` | Creature has base toughness 4 |\n| `test_wizard_subtype_after_transformation` | \"Wizard\" subtype granted |\n| `test_repeated_activation_no_change` | Activating {5} when already a creature is a no-op (guard: \"if this land isn't a creature\") |\n\n### TestGreatHallInstantSorceryTrigger — Instant/sorcery cast trigger\n\n| Test | Requirement validated |\n|---|---|\n| `test_register_triggers_does_not_raise` | `register_triggers()` safe to call before transformation |\n| `test_instant_cast_triggers_power_boost` | Casting an instant grants +1/+0 to the creature |\n| `test_sorcery_cast_triggers_power_boost` | Casting a sorcery also triggers +1/+0 |\n| `test_non_instant_sorcery_does_not_trigger` | Non-instant/sorcery (e.g., creature) does NOT trigger |\n| `test_trigger_not_registered_before_transformation` | Pre-transformation, no trigger fires for instant/sorcery casts |\n\n**Edge cases deliberately not covered:**\n- \"Until end of turn\" cleanup: verifying the +1/+0 goes away at cleanup requires running the full turn engine. The continuous-effect expiry is engine-level behavior already tested in `engine_tests/`. We verify the boost is applied; the expiry is trusted to the `DURATION_END_OF_TURN` mechanism.\n- Multiple instants cast in the same turn: the spec says each instant/sorcery triggers separately (+1/+0 per spell), which follows from the single-trigger test above.\n- Opponent casting an instant — the trigger is worded \"whenever YOU cast\", so opponent casts should not trigger. This would require a cast from a different controller; it's testable but would expand scope beyond the core requirements.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4939,"cache_read_input_tokens":53353,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4939,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01WCFp6ydLbtYch5PGnC6zGM","session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"fca732fc-24df-4cef-bd93-252d63a38ed2","request_id":"req_011CbUgyE9U6nWPXdRCTwCyh","subagent_type":"Tester","task_description":"Tester for sos_257"}
