{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WCFp6ydLbtYch5PGnC6zGM","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The 5 passing tests are logically correct: they verify the *absence* of things (`no mana cost`, `not a creature`, `no power/toughness initially`) and safety no-ops (`register_triggers doesn't raise`, `no trigger fires before transformation`). These are all true on the stub by construction and are genuine requirements — they verify the stub already satisfies these negative requirements, which is correct TDD behavior.\n\nEverything looks good. Here is the status summary:\n\n---\n\n```\nTESTS_WRITTEN\ntest_files: 1\ntest_cases: 26\nrationale_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/test-rationale.md\nfiles_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/test-files.txt\nuntestable_count: 2\nuntestable_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/untestable.json\nnotes: wrote 26 test cases for sos_257 Great Hall of the Biblioplex across 4 test classes; 21 fail on the stub (TDD red phase), 5 pass for correct negative-requirement assertions; 2 requirements recorded as untestable (mana-spending restriction enforcement and end-of-turn power expiry)\n```"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: ad08e41ac3594e32e (use SendMessage with to: 'ad08e41ac3594e32e' to continue this agent)\n<usage>total_tokens: 63613\ntool_uses: 46\nduration_ms: 208994</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"9bd4b336-a9b6-4a87-b23d-69141c8365ea","timestamp":"2026-05-28T08:58:52.660Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Write pytest tests for the SOS card sos_257 (Great Hall of the Biblioplex).\n\nCard spec path: /workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/card_spec.json\nCard impl stub: /workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/card_impl.py\nOutput directory: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/\n\nKey files for context:\n- AGENTS.md: /workspace/AGENTS.md\n- PROJECT_MAP.md: /workspace/PROJECT_MAP.md\n- KEY_DECISIONS.md: /workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md