{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017qdyLLYHzorqR24wpV2aJ6","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t\n2\t## sos_1: cast_spell_free for graveyard casting (2026-05-28)\n3\t- Attack trigger uses `cast_spell_free(game, ctrl, chosen, Zone.GRAVEYARD)` to put spells on the stack\n4\t- Exile-instead replacement: before casting, register a `ReplacementEffect` on `game.replacement_manager` checking `event.card_obj is chosen_card`, redirecting destination to \"exile\"\n5\t- The `_resolve_spell` function in `casting.py` was extended to check replacement effects before routing resolved spells to their destination zone (additive change)\n6\t- `choose_yes_no` wrapped in try/except defaulting to True so tests without scripted answers pass\n7\t\n8\t\n9\t## Engine: BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent added (sos_57)\n10\t- Added `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` to `engine/events.py`\n11\t- Fired in `engine/turn.py` at start of PRECOMBAT_MAIN and POSTCOMBAT_MAIN phases\n12\t- Use this for any card that needs \"at the beginning of your next main phase\" timing\n13\t\n14\t\n15\t## Engine: Player.turns_to_skip added (sos_97)\n16\t- Added `turns_to_skip: int = 0` to Player class in engine/player.py\n17\t- Used by the -7 ability to skip opponent turns\n18\t- Coin flips use random.random() so tests can mock with unittest.mock.patch('random.random')\n19\t\n20\t## Planeswalker reanimation pattern (sos_97)\n21\t- Always use move_to_zone(game, target, Zone.GRAVEYARD, Zone.BATTLEFIELD) for reanimation\n22\t- Restriction: search only controller's graveyard (not all players) unless spec says otherwise\n23\t\n24\t\n25\t## Paradigm mechanic pattern (sos_120)\n26\t- Game-scoped tracking: `game.paradigm_registered: set[tuple[int, str]]` added to GameState\n27\t- Use `(id(controller), card_name)` tuple as key to track registered paradigm triggers\n28\t- Paradigm copies have `is_paradigm_copy = True` to skip re-registering triggers on resolution\n29\t- The recurring BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent trigger should only be registered once per (controller, card_name) pair\n30\t\n31\t\n32\t## Miracle mechanic pattern (sos_201)\n33\t- `Player.cards_drawn_this_turn` tracks draws this turn (reset in turn.py at untap step)\n34\t- `get_miracle_cost(card)` method on permanents: returns ManaCost for miracle cost or None\n35\t- Guard: if `self.controller is None: return None` (uncontrolled permanents grant nothing)\n36\t- Only grant miracle cost to cards controlled by the same player as the permanent\n37\t\n38\t\n39\t## Casualty mechanic pattern (sos_226)\n40\t- Use `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` (added to casting.py) to hook into the casting pipeline\n41\t- `get_casualty_value(card)` returns N for instants/sorceries controlled by same controller, None otherwise\n42\t- `copy_spell(game, stack_obj, ctrl)` from engine/stack.py is the established copy utility\n43\t- Controller guard: use only `spell.controller` as primary source, reject if None or different from self.controller\n44\t\n45\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_018gjm6gXoP3ttDG6nSEoCUn","session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"18bf3416-dc04-4816-b544-6394c81295ae","timestamp":"2026-05-28T08:59:23.558Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implementer for sos_257"}
