gm trigger deduplication\"\n38\t        }\n39\t      ]\n40\t    },\n41\t    {\n42\t      \"card\": \"sos_13\",\n43\t      \"tests\": [\n44\t        {\n45\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_13/tests.py\",\n46\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_13 Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares: static properties, ETB trigger registration/effect (Inkling token creation), prepared mechanic state, and cast_prepared_spell (exile + life gain using current power)\"\n47\t        }\n48\t      ],\n49\t      \"implementation\": [\n50\t        {\n51\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_13/card_impl.py\",\n52\t          \"summary\": \"EmeritusOfTruceSwordsToPlowshares: revised cast_prepared_spell to use current in-game power (getattr power fallback to base_power) instead of base_power for life gain, per Swords to Plowshares rule 701.13a\"\n53\t        }\n54\t      ]\n55\t    },\n56\t    {\n57\t      \"card\": \"sos_201\",\n58\t      \"tests\": [\n59\t        {\n60\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py\",\n61\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_201 Lorehold the Historian: static properties, miracle cost grant for instants/sorceries, opponent upkeep trigger registration/firing, discard-then-draw effect, and decline-to-discard behavior\"\n62\t        }\n63\t      ],\n64\t      \"implementation\": [\n65\t        {\n66\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_201/card_impl.py\",\n67\t          \"summary\": \"LoreholdTheHistorian: fixed get_miracle_cost controller guard (early return when ctrl is None; correct identity check otherwise)\"\n68\t        },\n69\t        {\n70\t          \"path\": \"engine/player.py\",\n71\t          \"summary\": \"Added cards_drawn_this_turn: int = 0 attribute to Player.__init__ for miracle draw tracking\"\n72\t        },\n73\t        {\n74\t          \"path\": \"engine/stack.py\",\n75\t          \"summary\": \"Added size() method to Stack class as alias for __len__\"\n76\t        },\n77\t        {\n78\t          \"path\": \"engine/turn.py\",\n79\t          \"summary\": \"Reset active.cards_drawn_this_turn = 0 in _do_untap_step so miracle tracking resets each turn\"\n80\t        }\n81\t      ]\n82\t    },\n83\t    {\n84\t      \"card\": \"sos_226\",\n85\t      \"tests\": [\n86\t        {\n87\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_226/tests.py\",\n88\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_226 Silverquill the Disputant: static properties, get_casualty_value API (instant/sorcery=1, other=None, opponent/uncontrolled=None), and _apply_casualty_for_spell mechanic (sacrifice, copy on stack, decline, no eligible creature)\"\n89\t        }\n90\t      ],\n91\t      \"implementation\": [\n92\t        {\n93\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_226/card_impl.py\",\n94\t          \"summary\": \"SilverquillTheDisputant: fixed controller resolution to use spell.controller directly; replaced copy.copy with copy_spell() utility; register_triggers hooked to SpellCastTriggeredEvent for real-game integration\"\n95\t        },\n96\t        {\n97\t          \"path\": \"engine/casting.py\",\n98\t          \"summary\": \"Fire SpellCastTriggeredEvent after pushing spell StackObject so permanents like Silverquill can react via register_triggers\"\n99\t        }\n100\t      ]\n101\t    },\n102\t    {\n103\t      \"card\": \"sos_245\",\n104\t      \"tests\": [\n105\t        {\n106\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_245/tests.py\",\n107\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_245 Witherbloom the Balancer: static properties, cost_reduction affinity for creatures (own + grants to instants/sorceries), controller isolation, and uncontrolled guard\"\n108\t        }\n109\t      ],\n110\t      \"implementation\": [\n111\t        {\n112\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_245/card_impl.py\",\n113\t          \"summary\": \"WitherbloomTheBalancer: 5/5 Legendary Elder Dragon with Flying/Deathtouch, cost_reduction counting controller's creatures, get_affinity_cost_reduction granting same to controller's instants/sorceries\"\n114\t        }\n115\t      ]\n116\t    },\n117\t    {\n118\t      \"card\": \"sos_257\",\n119\t      \"tests\": [\n120\t        {\n121\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py\",\n122\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_257 Great Hall of the Biblioplex: static properties, colorless mana ability, life-pay colored mana ability, {5} creature transformation (2/4 Wizard), idempotent repeated activation, and SpellCastTriggeredEvent +1/+0 trigger\"\n123\t        }\n124\t      ],\n125\t      \"implementation\": [\n126\t        {\n127\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_257/card_impl.py\",\n128\t          \"summary\": \"GreatHallOfTheBiblioplex: Land with two mana abilities, {5} creature-transformation ability (idempotent), and SpellCastTriggeredEvent trigger granting +1/+0 while a creature\"\n129\t        }\n130\t      ]\n131\t    },\n132\t    {\n133\t      \"card\": \"sos_4\",\n134\t      \"tests\": [\n135\t        {\n136\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_4/tests.py\",\n137\t          \"summary\": \"Tests for sos_4 Together as One: static properties, colors_spent converge attribute, on_resolve with X=0/1/3/5, creature vs player damage, life gain to controller\"\n138\t        }\n139\t      ],\n140\t      \"implementation\": [\n141\t        {\n142\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_4/card_impl.py\",\n143\t          \"summary\": \"TogetherAsOne: Sorcery with colors_spent, on_resolve draws X cards, deals X damage, controller gains X life with GainsLifeTriggeredEvent fired\"\n144\t        }\n145\t      ]\n146\t    },\n147\t    {\n148\t      \"card\": \"sos_57\",\n149\t      \"tests\": [\n150\t        {\n151\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py\",\n152\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_57 Mana Sculpt: static properties, counterspell effect (removes from stack), Wizard conditional for delayed mana trigger registration, and mana amount equal to countered spell's CMC\"\n153\t        }\n154\t      ],\n155\t      \"implementation\": [\n156\t        {\n157\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_57/card_impl.py\",\n158\t          \"summary\": \"ManaSculpt: Instant that counters target spell from stack and registers a one-shot BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent trigger for colorless mana equal to countered spell's CMC if controller has a Wizard\"\n159\t        },\n160\t        {\n161\t          \"path\": \"engine/events.py\",\n162\t          \"summary\": \"Added BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent dataclass with active_player and phase fields\"\n163\t        },\n164\t        {\n165\t          \"path\": \"engine/turn.py\",\n166\t          \"summary\": \"Fire BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent at the start of PRECOMBAT_MAIN and POSTCOMBAT_MAIN phases in run_turn()\"\n167\t        }\n168\t      ]\n169\t    },\n170\t    {\n171\t      \"card\": \"sos_97\",\n172\t      \"tests\": [\n173\t        {\n174\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_97/tests.py\",\n175\t          \"summary\": \"tests for sos_97 Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer: static properties, +1 surveil 2, -1 any-number-of-players discard, -2 reanimate creature mv<=3 from controller-only graveyard, -7 coin-flip turn-skip ultimatum\"\n176\t        }\n177\t      ],\n178\t      \"implementation\": [\n179\t        {\n180\t          \"path\": \"cards/sos/sos_97/card_impl.py\",\n181\t          \"summary\": \"RalZarekGuestLecturer: -2 now restricts to controller's graveyard only and uses move_to_zone for correct ETB/trigger firing; +1 surveil-2, -1 multi-target discard, -7 coin-flip turn-skip\"\n182\t        },\n183\t        {\n184\t          \"path\": \"engine/player.py\",\n185\t          \"summary\": \"Added turns_to_skip: int = 0 attribute to Player.__init__ for turn-skip tracking\"\n186\t        }\n187\t      ]\n188\t    }\n189\t  ]\n190\t}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01APFPyzDJRnKVZbMCsaQmw3","session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"d1714899-ffb5-4595-b677-ec3109bf71f4","timestamp":"2026-05-28T09:02:01.442Z","subagent_type":"Reviewer","task_description":"Reviewer for sos_257"}
