e characteristics to their original (pre-effect) values.\n/workspace/engine/card.py-184-\nengine/card.py:185:        Called by :meth:`EffectManager.apply_all` before reapplying effects\n/workspace/engine/card.py-186-        so that the recalculation is idempotent.\n/workspace/engine/card.py-187-        \"\"\"\n--\n/workspace/engine/card.py-317-        self.minus_one_counters = self._base_minus_one_counters\n/workspace/engine/card.py-318-        # Reset combat-restriction flags set by continuous effects (e.g. Pacifism).\nengine/card.py:319:        # These are reapplied by active effects during apply_all().\nengine/card.py-320-        self._cant_attack: bool = False\nengine/card.py-321-        self._cant_block: bool = False\n--\n/workspace/engine/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md-21-| `abilities.py` | 273 | `activate_ability()`, `tap_cost()`, `ActivatedAbilityInstance`, `LoyaltyAbilityInstance` (per-turn tracking), `AbilityError`. Mana abilities resolve immediately; non-mana go on stack. |\n/workspace/engine/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md-22-| `triggers.py` | 175+ | `EventType` enum (14 events including `END_STEP`), `TriggerRegistration` dataclass, `TriggerManager` (register/unregister/fire_event with APNAP ordering). |\nengine/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md:23:| `continuous_effects.py` | 247 | `Layer` (7 layers), `SubLayer` (7a–7d), `ContinuousEffect` dataclass, `EffectManager` (add/remove/apply_all with reset-then-reapply idempotency). Duration constants. |\n/workspace/engine/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md-24-| `replacement_effects.py` | 209 | `ReplacementEffect` dataclass, `ReplacementManager` (register/unregister/apply with self-replacement prevention and player-choice ordering). |\nengine/DIRECTORY_SUMMARY.md-25-| `state_based_actions.py` | 350+ | 8 SBAs: life≤0, toughness≤0, lethal damage (incl. deathtouch), empty library, legend rule, token cleanup, aura validity (extended for protection), counter annihilation. `check_state_based_actions()` (single pass), `resolve_state_based_actions()` (loop until stable with trigger queueing, returns bool). Fires `CREATURE_DIES`/`LEAVES_BATTLEFIELD` events in `_move_to_graveyard()`. Detaches auras/equipment from permanents with protection from them. |"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01G2e598QbNSk9fWuA5YScYP","session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"17ea262d-beec-47cf-a10c-07336785a956","timestamp":"2026-05-28T09:05:18.215Z","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implementer revision for sos_257"}
