{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_013rqRbJAYYdnRRRsexeA359","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019pqLEZKnEfVUM3KrZrbznt","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl-revised-rationale.md","content":"# Revised Implementation Rationale — sos_257 Great Hall of the Biblioplex\n\n## Strict Issue Fixed\n\n### Power boost \"until end of turn\" expiry (line ~207)\n\nThe original implementation directly mutated `source.power_bonus += 1` and\n`source.modified_power`, with no mechanism to reset these at end of turn. This\ncaused permanent, accumulating power bonuses.\n\n**Fix applied: OPTION A — ContinuousEffect with DURATION_END_OF_TURN**\n\nThe `_effect` function in `_register_spell_cast_trigger` was changed to:\n1. Register a `ContinuousEffect(source=source, layer=Layer.POWER_TOUGHNESS, sublayer=SubLayer.MODIFY_PT, apply=_apply, duration=DURATION_END_OF_TURN)` via `game.effect_manager.add(...)`.\n2. Call `game.effect_manager.apply_all(game)` immediately after registering the effect, so that `modified_power` is updated in the current game state and the tests can read it.\n\nThe `apply` callable does `source.modified_power += 1`. Because `EffectManager.apply_all()` first calls `_reset_characteristics()` on all battlefield objects before reapplying effects, `modified_power` is reset to `base_power` before each effect accumulation cycle. This ensures multiple casts in the same turn correctly stack the count, but all stacks are wiped at cleanup.\n\n**Additional change: `_reset_characteristics` override**\n\n`GreatHallOfTheBiblioplex` is a `Land` subclass, not `Creature`. The base `Land`\n(`CardImpl`) `_reset_characteristics()` only resets `card_types` and `keywords`, not\n`modified_power`/`modified_toughness`. An override was added that calls `super()`\nthen, when `self.is_creature` is `True`, resets `modified_power = base_power` and\n`modified_toughness = base_toughness`. This is required for `apply_all()` to work\ncorrectly (otherwise `modified_power` would never be reset before reapplication).\n\n**Pattern used**: Consistent with `cards/fdn/fdn_78/card_impl.py` (BattlesongBerserker)\nwhich uses the same `ContinuousEffect + DURATION_END_OF_TURN + apply_all` pattern.\n\n## Imports added\n- `from engine.continuous_effects import ContinuousEffect, DURATION_END_OF_TURN, Layer, SubLayer`\n\n## Advisory comments\n- Advisory comment 1 (mana restriction tagging) — acknowledged; no change required\n  as no engine mechanism exists for this.\n- Advisory comment 2 (`_trigger_registered` flag drift) — acknowledged; no change\n  required as the current engine lifecycle conventions make this safe.\n\n## Tests\nAll 26 tests continue to pass after the revision.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":121,"cache_read_input_tokens":47808,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":121,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":55,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01G2e598QbNSk9fWuA5YScYP","session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"62efc667-dd25-4756-a6bb-7f497ea0bf37","request_id":"req_011CbUhc3eUSHnxPvHSz1uEN","subagent_type":"Implementer","task_description":"Implementer revision for sos_257"}
