{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01G2e598QbNSk9fWuA5YScYP","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"REVISION_DONE\ndisagreement_count: 0\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl-revised.diff\ndisagreements_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/disagreements.json\n\nThe strict issue was fixed by replacing the direct `power_bonus` mutation with a `ContinuousEffect(DURATION_END_OF_TURN)` registered via `game.effect_manager.add()`, followed by `game.effect_manager.apply_all(game)` to immediately reflect the change in `modified_power`. A `_reset_characteristics()` override was also added to the `Land`-based class to properly reset `modified_power = base_power` in creature form, enabling the reset-then-reapply idempotency that the `EffectManager` relies on. All 26 tests continue to pass."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: ad84b49713906c70f (use SendMessage with to: 'ad84b49713906c70f' to continue this agent)\n<usage>total_tokens: 56914\ntool_uses: 39\nduration_ms: 178230</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eab38cf5-7da5-43e8-ba85-a59c2942584c","uuid":"9cf3b02f-1be9-4c6a-9437-f69bf22d4131","timestamp":"2026-05-28T09:07:02.419Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Revise the implementation of SOS card sos_257 (Great Hall of the Biblioplex) to address strict reviewer comments.\n\nImplementation file: /workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/card_impl.py\nTests file: /workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py (DO NOT MODIFY)\nReview comments: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/review.json\nFILES_MODIFIED.json: /workspace/FILES_MODIFIED.json\nEngine source: /workspace/engine/card.py, /workspace/engine/events.py, /workspace/engine/triggers.py\n\nSTRICT ISSUES TO FIX:\n\n1. (line ~207) The power boost \"until end of turn\" is not being properly expired.\n   The trigger effect currently does `source.power_bonus += 1` with no expiry.\n   \n   Fix options:\n   OPTION A: Use game.effect_manager to register a DURATION_END_OF_TURN continuous effect for +1 power.\n   Look at how other cards use game.effect_manager for end-of-turn effects. Check engine/effects.py or similar.\n   \n   OPTION B: Register a one-shot trigger on BeginningOfCleanupTriggeredEvent (or EndOfTurnTriggeredEvent) that resets power_bonus to 0.\n   \n   OPTION C: Use the existing engine's \"until end of turn\" effect system if available.\n   \n   Look at how existing cards implement \"gets +X/+Y until end of turn\" effects. Check FDN implementations that use such effects. Pick the approach that is consistent with existing engine conventions.\n\n   The key requirement: the +1/+0 power boost must expire at end of turn, not accumulate permanently.\n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n- Apply ALL strict review comments.\n- Do NOT modify the test file.\n- Run the tests to ensure all 26 tests still pass.\n- Write output to /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl-revised.diff, impl-revised-rationale.md\n- Update FILES_MODIFIED.json entry for sos_257 in place.\n\nReturn:\nREVISION_DONE\ndisagreement_count: N\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl-revised.diff\ndisagreements_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/disagreements.json","agentId":"ad84b49713906c70f","agentType":"Implementer","content":[{"type":"text","text":"REVISION_DONE\ndisagreement_count: 0\ndiff_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/impl-revised.diff\ndisagreements_path: /tmp/coordinator-run/sos_257/disagreements.json\n\nThe strict issue was fixed by replacing the direct `power_bonus` mutation with a `ContinuousEffect(DURATION_END_OF_TURN)` registered via `game.effect_manager.add()`, followed by `game.effect_manager.apply_all(game)` to immediately reflect the change in `modified_power`. A `_reset_characteristics()` override was also added to the `Land`-based class to properly reset `modified_power = base_power` in creature form, enabling the reset-then-reapply idempotency that the `EffectManager` relies on. All 26 tests continue to pass."}],"totalDurationMs":178230,"totalTokens":5